DG.put("jaapu-saahib/1",{"n":1,"title":null,"title_roman":null,"page":84,"blocks":[{"type":"heading","kind":"subtitle","name":"ਜਾਪੁ","gurmukhi":"ਜਾਪੁ","roman":"Jaapu","meaning_en":"Jaap (the recitation).","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"invocation","gurmukhi":"ਸ੍ਰੀ ਮੁਖਵਾਕ ਪਾਤਿਸਾਹੀ ੧੦","roman":"Sree mukhvaak paatisaahee 10","meaning_en":"Uttered by the sacred mouth of the Tenth Master.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਛਪੈ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਛਪੈ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Chhapai chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Chhapai metre. By Your grace.","page":84,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1],"number_text":"੧।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਕ੍ਰ ਚਿਹਨ ਅਰੁ ਬਰਨ ਜਾਤਿ ਅਰੁ ਪਾਤਿ ਨਹਿਨ ਜਿਹ।","roman":"Chakr chihan aru baran jaati aru paati nahin jih |","meaning_en":"He who has no mark or sign, no colour or varna (social class), no caste and no lineage;","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਚਕ੍ਰ is read as 'distinguishing mark / feature'; ਬਰਨ can mean colour or varna (class). Both are given."},{"gurmukhi":"ਰੂਪ ਰੰਗ ਅਰੁ ਰੇਖ ਭੇਖ ਕੋਊ ਕਹਿ ਨ ਸਕਤਿ ਕਿਹ।","roman":"Roop rang aru rekh bhekh ko'oo kahi na sakti kih |","meaning_en":"whose form, colour, outline or garb no one can describe;","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਚਲ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਅਨਭਵ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ ਅਮਿਤੋਜ ਕਹਿਜੈ।","roman":"Achal moorti anbhav prakaas amitoj kahijai |","meaning_en":"He is called the immovable Form, the Light known through inner experience, of boundless radiance;","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਭਵ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ is read either as 'self-illumined light' or 'light known by inner experience'. ਅਮਿਤੋਜ = of immeasurable might / radiance."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕੋਟਿ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਇੰਦ੍ਰਾਣਿ ਸਾਹੁ ਸਾਹਾਣਿ ਗਣਿਜੈ।","roman":"Koti indr indraani saahu saahaani ganijai |","meaning_en":"He is reckoned the Lord of millions of Indras, the King of kings;","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਇੰਦ੍ਰਾਣਿ, ਸਾਹਾਣਿ: read as 'lord of Indras' and 'emperor of emperors'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭਵਣ ਮਹੀਪ ਸੁਰ ਨਰ ਅਸੁਰ ਨੇਤਿ ਨੇਤਿ ਬਨ ਤ੍ਰਿਣ ਕਹਤ।","roman":"Tribhvan maheep sur nar asur neti neti ban trin kahat |","meaning_en":"Sovereign of the three worlds; gods, humans and demons, and even the grass of the forests, say of Him 'not this, not this'.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨੇਤਿ ਨੇਤਿ: 'not this, not this', i.e. He is beyond all description. ਬਨ ਤ੍ਰਿਣ: the forests and the blades of grass."},{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਵ ਸਰਬ ਨਾਮ ਕਥੈ ਕਵਨ ਕਰਮ ਨਾਮ ਬਰਣਤ ਸੁਮਤਿ। ੧।","roman":"Tva sarab naam kathai kavan karam naam barnat sumti | 1 |","meaning_en":"Who can tell all Your names? The wise describe You by names drawn from Your deeds.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਰਮ ਨਾਮ = attributive names, names that come from His deeds (as opposed to a personal name)."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,2],"number_text":"੧। ੨।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਵਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਲੇ।","roman":"Navastvan akaale | namastvan kripaale |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Timeless; salutation to You, the Merciful.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਨਵਸਤ੍ਵੰ (a printing slip for ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ); the meaning follows ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ, 'salutation to You'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਰੂਪੇ। ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਨੂਪੇ। ੧। ੨।","roman":"Namastvan aroope | namastvan anoope | 1 | 2 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Formless; salutation to You, the Incomparable.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,3],"number_text":"੨। ੩।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੇਖੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਲੇਖੇ।","roman":"Namastan abhekhe | namastan alekhe |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who wears no sectarian garb; salutation to You, who is beyond all account.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਲੇਖ: beyond writing / beyond any record or destiny; also read 'who cannot be described'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਕਾਏ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜਾਏ। ੨। ੩।","roman":"Namastan akaae | namastan ajaae | 2 | 3 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Bodiless; salutation to You, the Unborn.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,4],"number_text":"੩। ੪।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗੰਜੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੰਜੇ।","roman":"Namastan aganje | namastan abhanje |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Indestructible; salutation to You, the Unbreakable.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨਾਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਠਾਮੇ। ੩। ੪।","roman":"Namastan anaame | namastan athaame | 3 | 4 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Nameless; salutation to You, who has no fixed abode.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,5],"number_text":"੪। ੫।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਕਰਮੰ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਧਰਮੰ।","roman":"Namastan akarman | namastan adharman |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is beyond deeds (karma); salutation to You, who is beyond ritual religion.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਧਰਮੰ here means 'beyond (ritual) dharma', not 'unrighteous'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨਾਮੰ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਧਾਮੰ। ੪। ੫।","roman":"Namastan anaaman | namastan adhaaman | 4 | 5 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Nameless; salutation to You, the Abodeless.","page":84,"flags":[{"code":"ੰੰ","reason":"same sign typed twice; written once (prints as one)"}],"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,6],"number_text":"੫। ੬।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜੀਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੀਤੇ।","roman":"Namastan ajeete | namastan abheete |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Unconquerable; salutation to You, the Fearless.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਬਾਹੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਢਾਹੇ। ੫। ੬।","roman":"Namastan abaahe | namastan adhaahe | 5 | 6 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, whom none can move; salutation to You, whom none can overthrow.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਬਾਹੇ: read as 'who cannot be moved / carried' or 'who cannot be struck'. ਅਢਾਹੇ: who cannot be toppled."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,7],"number_text":"੬। ੭।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨੀਲੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨਾਦੇ।","roman":"Namastan aneele | namastan anaade |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Colourless; salutation to You, who has no beginning.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨੀਲੇ: read as 'colourless / stainless'; some read 'countless' (ਨੀਲ as a very large number)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਛੇਦੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗਾਧੇ। ੬। ੭।","roman":"Namastan achhede | namastan agaadhe | 6 | 7 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who cannot be cut; salutation to You, the Unfathomable.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,8],"number_text":"੭। ੮।","page":84,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗੰਜੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੰਜੇ।","roman":"Namastan aganje | namastan abhanje |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Indestructible; salutation to You, the Unbreakable.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਉਦਾਰੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਪਾਰੇ। ੭। ੮।","roman":"Namastan udaare | namastan apaare | 7 | 8 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Generous; salutation to You, the Boundless.","page":84,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,9],"number_text":"੮। ੯।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸੁ ਏਕੈ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨੇਕੈ।","roman":"Namastan su ekai | namastan anekai |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the One; salutation to You, who is also the many.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੂਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜੂਪੇ। ੮। ੯।","roman":"Namastan abhoote | namastan ajoope | 8 | 9 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is not made of the elements; salutation to You, who is free of all bonds.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭੂਤੇ: not made of the (five) elements. ਅਜੂਪੇ: read as 'unbound / not yoked to anything'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,10],"number_text":"੯। ੧੦।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਕਰਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਭਰਮੇ।","roman":"Namastan nrikarme | namastan nribharme |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is beyond deeds; salutation to You, who is free of illusion.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਦੇਸੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਭੇਸੇ। ੯। ੧੦।","roman":"Namastan nridese | namastan nribhese | 9 | 10 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who belongs to no country; salutation to You, who wears no particular garb.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,11],"number_text":"੧੦। ੧੧।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਨਾਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ।","roman":"Namastan nrinaame | namastan nrikaame |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Nameless; salutation to You, the Desireless.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਧਾਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨਿਘਾਤੇ। ੧੦। ੧੧।","roman":"Namastan nridhaate | namastan nighaate | 10 | 11 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is not made of matter; salutation to You, whom none can strike down.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨ੍ਰਿਧਾਤੇ: without any (bodily) element. ਨਿਘਾਤੇ: who cannot be destroyed / struck."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,12],"number_text":"੧੧। ੧੨।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਧੂਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੂਤੇ।","roman":"Namastan nridhoote | namastan abhoote |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Unshakeable; salutation to You, who is not made of the elements.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨ੍ਰਿਧੂਤੇ: read as 'who cannot be shaken' or 'free of all stain'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਲੋਕੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਸੋਕੇ। ੧੧। ੧੨।","roman":"Namastan aloke | namastan asoke | 11 | 12 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Unseen; salutation to You, who is free of sorrow.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਲੋਕੇ: 'unseen' or 'beyond the worlds'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[12,13],"number_text":"੧੨। ੧੩।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਤਾਪੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਥਾਪੇ।","roman":"Namastan nritaape | namastan athaape |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is free of affliction; salutation to You, whom no one established.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਥਾਪੇ: not installed by anyone, i.e. self-existent."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਤ੍ਰਿਮਾਨੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨਿਧਾਨੇ। ੧੨। ੧੩।","roman":"Namastan trimaane | namastan nidhaane | 12 | 13 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, honoured in the three worlds; salutation to You, the Treasure.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਮਾਨੇ: honoured in the three worlds; some read 'beyond the three qualities'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13,14],"number_text":"੧੩। ੧੪।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗਾਹੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਬਾਹੇ।","roman":"Namastan agaahe | namastan abaahe |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is beyond grasp; salutation to You, the Unshakeable.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਤ੍ਰਿਬਰਗੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਸਰਗੇ। ੧੩। ੧੪।","roman":"Namastan tribarge | namastan asarge | 13 | 14 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, giver of the three aims of life; salutation to You, who was never created.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਬਰਗ: dharma, artha and kama (righteousness, wealth, desire). ਅਸਰਗੇ: read as 'uncreated' or 'beyond creation'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[14,15],"number_text":"੧੪। ੧੫।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਪ੍ਰਭੋਗੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸੁਜੋਗੇ।","roman":"Namastan prabhoge | namastan sujoge |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Enjoyer of all; salutation to You, who is united with all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੁਜੋਗੇ: 'well-united (with all)'; some read 'perfect in union (yoga)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਰੰਗੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੰਗੇ। ੧੪। ੧੫।","roman":"Namastan arange | namastan abhange | 14 | 15 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Colourless; salutation to You, the Imperishable.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[15,16],"number_text":"੧੫। ੧੬।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗੰਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਰੰਮੇ।","roman":"Namastan aganme | namastastu ranme |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Inaccessible; salutation to You, the Beautiful One who pervades all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ (kept as printed); the meaning is 'salutation'. ਰੰਮੇ: beautiful / all-pervading."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਜਲਾਸਰੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨਿਰਾਸਰੇ। ੧੫। ੧੬।","roman":"Namastan jalaasre | namastan niraasre | 15 | 16 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Support of the waters; salutation to You, who needs no support.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਲਾਸਰੇ: read as 'support of the waters' or 'the ocean (reservoir) itself'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[16,17],"number_text":"੧੬। ੧੭।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜਾਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਪਾਤੇ।","roman":"Namastan ajaate | namastan apaate |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who has no caste; salutation to You, who has no lineage.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਮਜਬੇ। ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਅਜਬੇ। ੧੬। ੧੭।","roman":"Namastan amajbe | namastastu ajbe | 16 | 17 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who belongs to no religion; salutation to You, the Wondrous.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਮਜਬੇ: without a (formal) religion (ਮਜ਼ਹਬ). This edition prints ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ, kept as printed."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[17,18],"number_text":"੧੭। ੧੮।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਦੇਸੰ ਅਦੇਸੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੇਸੇ।","roman":"Adesan adese | namastan abhese |","meaning_en":"Salutations, salutations to You, who belongs to no land; salutation to You, who wears no garb.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਦੇਸੰ ਅਦੇਸੇ is read as 'adesh (a yogic salutation) to the One without a country'; some read both words as 'without a country'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਧਾਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਮੇ। ੧੭। ੧੮।","roman":"Namastan nridhaame | namastan nribaame | 17 | 18 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who has no abode; salutation to You, who has no consort.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਮੇ: without a wife / consort."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[18,19],"number_text":"੧੮। ੧੯।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਦਿਆਲੇ।","roman":"Namo sarab kaale | namo sarab diaale |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Destroyer of all; salutation to the One merciful to all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬ ਕਾਲੇ: 'death (destroyer) of all'; some read 'present at all times'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਰੂਪੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੂਪੇ। ੧੮। ੧੯।","roman":"Namo sarab roope | namo sarab bhoope | 18 | 19 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One of all forms; salutation to the King of all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[19,20],"number_text":"੧੯। ੨੦।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਖਾਪੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਥਾਪੇ।","roman":"Namo sarab khaape | namo sarab thaape |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Destroyer of all; salutation to the Establisher of all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਪਾਲੇ। ੧੯। ੨੦।","roman":"Namo sarab kaale | namo sarab paale | 19 | 20 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Death of all; salutation to the Sustainer of all.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[20,21],"number_text":"੨੦। ੨੧।","page":85,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਦੇਵੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੇਵੇ।","roman":"Namastastu deve | namastan abheve |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Divine; salutation to You, whose secret none can know.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ, kept as printed."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜਨਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸੁਬਨਮੇ। ੨੦। ੨੧।","roman":"Namastan ajanme | namastan subanme | 20 | 21 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Unborn; salutation to You, of most beautiful form.","page":85,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੁਬਨਮੇ: read as 'beautiful / of fine form'; some read 'well-adorned'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[21,22],"number_text":"੨੧। ੨੨।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਗਉਨੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭਉਨੇ।","roman":"Namo sarab gaune | namo sarab bhaune |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One who goes everywhere; salutation to the One who dwells in every abode.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਰੰਗੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੰਗੇ। ੨੧। ੨੨।","roman":"Namo sarab range | namo sarab bhange | 21 | 22 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One present in all colours (all forms); salutation to the Destroyer of all.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[22,23],"number_text":"੨੨। ੨੩।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਕਾਲੇ ਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਦਿਆਲੇ।","roman":"Namo kaale kaale | namastastu diaale |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Death of death; salutation to the Merciful.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ, kept as printed."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਬਰਨੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਮਰਨੇ। ੨੨। ੨੩।","roman":"Namastan abarne | namastan amarne | 22 | 23 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who has no colour or class; salutation to You, the Deathless.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[23,24],"number_text":"੨੩। ੨੪।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਜਰਾਰੰ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਕ੍ਰਿਤਾਰੰ।","roman":"Namastan jaraaran | namastan kritaaran |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, untouched by old age; salutation to You, the Creator.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਰਾਰੰ: read as 'beyond old age' or 'destroyer of old age'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਧੰਧੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਤ ਅਬੰਧੇ। ੨੩। ੨੪।","roman":"Namo sarab dhandhe | namo sat abandhe | 23 | 24 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One engaged in all affairs; salutation to the One ever unbound.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਤ ਅਬੰਧੇ: 'the true, unbound One' or 'ever unbound'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[24,25],"number_text":"੨੪। ੨੫।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਸਾਕੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਕੇ।","roman":"Namastan nrisaake | namastan nribaake |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who has no kin; salutation to You, the Fearless.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਕੇ is read as 'fearless' or 'beyond speech'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਰਹੀਮੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਕਰੀਮੇ। ੨੪। ੨੫।","roman":"Namastan raheeme | namastan kareeme | 24 | 25 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Compassionate (Rahim); salutation to You, the Gracious (Karim).","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਹੀਮ and ਕਰੀਮ are Arabic names of God."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[25,26],"number_text":"੨੫। ੨੬।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਨੰਤੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਮਹੰਤੇ।","roman":"Namastan anante | namastan mahante |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Infinite; salutation to You, the Great.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਰਾਗੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸੁਹਾਗੇ। ੨੫। ੨੬।","roman":"Namastastu raage | namastan suhaage | 25 | 26 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who is love itself; salutation to You, the auspicious Lord (of all).","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਾਗੇ: love / affection, or 'music'. ਸੁਹਾਗੇ: the auspicious husband of all souls. This edition prints ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ, kept as printed."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[26,27],"number_text":"੨੬। ੨੭।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਸੋਖੰ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਪੋਖੰ।","roman":"Namo sarab sokhan | namo sarab pokhan |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One who dries up (consumes) all; salutation to the Nourisher of all.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਕਰਤਾ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਹਰਤਾ। ੨੬। ੨੭।","roman":"Namo sarab kartaa | namo sarab hartaa | 26 | 27 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Creator of all; salutation to the Destroyer of all.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[27,28],"number_text":"੨੭। ੨੮।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇ। ਨਮੋ ਭੋਗ ਭੋਗੇ।","roman":"Namo jog joge | namo bhog bhoge |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Yogi of yogis; salutation to the Enjoyer of enjoyments.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਦਿਆਲੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਪਾਲੇ। ੨੭। ੨੮।","roman":"Namo sarab diaale | namo sarab paale | 27 | 28 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One merciful to all; salutation to the Sustainer of all.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Chaachree chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Chachari metre. By Your grace.","page":86,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,29],"number_text":"੧। ੨੯।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੂ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੂ ਹੈਂ। ੧। ੨੯।","roman":"Aroop hain | anoop hain | ajoo hain | abhoo hain | 1 | 29 |","meaning_en":"You are formless, You are incomparable, You are unmoving, You are not made of the elements.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜੂ: read as 'unmoving / firm' or 'unborn'. ਅਭੂ: not of the earth / elements."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,30],"number_text":"੨। ੩੦।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨਾਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਕਾਮ ਹੈਂ। ੨। ੩੦।","roman":"Alekh hain | abhekh hain | anaam hain | akaam hain | 2 | 30 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond account, You wear no garb, You are nameless, You are desireless.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,31],"number_text":"੩। ੩੧।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਧੇ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੀਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੀਤ ਹੈਂ। ੩। ੩੧।","roman":"Adhe hain | abhe hain | ajeet hain | abheet hain | 3 | 31 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond thought, You are beyond distinction, You are unconquerable, You are fearless.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਧੇ and ਅਭੇ are uncertain: ਅਧੇ is read as 'beyond thought / not held by anything'; ਅਭੇ as 'undivided' or 'fearless'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,32],"number_text":"੪। ੩੨।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ। ਨਿਧਾਨ ਹੈਂ। ਤ੍ਰਿਬਰਗ ਹੈਂ। ਅਸਰਗ ਹੈਂ। ੪। ੩੨।","roman":"Trimaan hain | nidhaan hain | tribrag hain | asrag hain | 4 | 32 |","meaning_en":"You are honoured in the three worlds, You are the treasure, You are the giver of the three aims of life, You were never created.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,33],"number_text":"੫। ੩੩।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੀਲ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੇ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ੫। ੩੩।","roman":"Aneel hain | anaadi hain | aje hain | ajaadi hain | 5 | 33 |","meaning_en":"You are colourless, You are without beginning, You are unconquerable, You are free and unborn.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜੇ: unconquerable (ਅਜੈ). ਅਜਾਦਿ: read as 'unborn and without beginning' or 'free'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,34],"number_text":"੬। ੩੪।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜਨਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਬਰਨ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੂਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭਰਨ ਹੈਂ। ੬। ੩੪।","roman":"Ajnam hain | abran hain | abhoot hain | abhran hain | 6 | 34 |","meaning_en":"You are unborn, You are beyond colour and class, You are not made of the elements, You need no sustenance.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭਰਨ: read as 'needing no sustenance' or 'needing no ornament'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,35],"number_text":"੭। ੩੫।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਜ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੰਜ ਹੈਂ। ਅਝੂਝ ਹੈਂ। ਅਝੰਝ ਹੈਂ। ੭। ੩੫।","roman":"Aganj hain | abhanj hain | ajhoojh hain | ajhanjh hain | 7 | 35 |","meaning_en":"You are indestructible, You are unbreakable, You cannot be fought, You are free of all entanglement.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,36],"number_text":"੮। ੩੬।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮੀਕ ਹੈਂ। ਰਫੀਕ ਹੈਂ। ਅਧੰਧ ਹੈਂ। ਅਬੰਧ ਹੈਂ। ੮। ੩੬।","roman":"Ameek hain | rapheek hain | adhandh hain | abandh hain | 8 | 36 |","meaning_en":"You are deep beyond measure, You are the Friend, You are free of worldly affairs, You are unbound.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਫੀਕ is Persian for 'friend, companion'. ਅਮੀਕ: very deep (from Arabic 'amiq')."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,37],"number_text":"੯। ੩੭।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਬੂਝ ਹੈਂ। ਅਸੂਝ ਹੈਂ। ਅਕਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ੯। ੩੭।","roman":"Nriboojh hain | asoojh hain | akaal hain | ajaal hain | 9 | 37 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond understanding, You are beyond perception, You are timeless, You are free of every snare.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜਾਲ: free of the net (of illusion / death)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,38],"number_text":"੧੦। ੩੮।","page":86,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨੰਤ ਹੈਂ। ਮਹੰਤ ਹੈਂ। ੧੦। ੩੮।","roman":"Alaah hain | ajaah hain | anant hain | mahant hain | 10 | 38 |","meaning_en":"You are Allah, You have no fixed place, You are infinite, You are the Great One.","page":86,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਲਾਹ is read as 'Allah' (God); some read it as 'beyond place'. ਅਜਾਹ: without a place (ਜਾਹ, Persian 'place')."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,39],"number_text":"੧੧। ੩੯।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲੀਕ ਹੈਂ। ਨ੍ਰਿਸਰੀਕ ਹੈਂ। ਨ੍ਰਿਲੰਭ ਹੈਂ। ਅਸੰਭ ਹੈਂ। ੧੧। ੩੯।","roman":"Aleek hain | nrisreek hain | nrilanbh hain | asanbh hain | 11 | 39 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond any line (limit), You have no equal, You need no support, You are not born.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਲੀਕ: read as 'without a line / limit' or 'not false'. ਨ੍ਰਿਲੰਭ: without support. ਅਸੰਭ: not born (self-existent)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[12,40],"number_text":"੧੨। ੪੦।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੰਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੂਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਛੂਤ ਹੈਂ। ੧੨। ੪੦।","roman":"Aganm hain | ajanm hain | abhoot hain | achhoot hain | 12 | 40 |","meaning_en":"You are inaccessible, You are unborn, You are not made of the elements, You are untouched (by anything).","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13,41],"number_text":"੧੩। ੪੧।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲੋਕ ਹੈਂ। ਅਸੋਕ ਹੈਂ। ਅਕਰਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭਰਮ ਹੈਂ। ੧੩। ੪੧।","roman":"Alok hain | asok hain | akram hain | abhram hain | 13 | 41 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond the worlds, You are free of sorrow, You are beyond deeds, You are free of illusion.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[14,42],"number_text":"੧੪। ੪੨।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜੀਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੀਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਬਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ਅਗਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ੧੪। ੪੨।","roman":"Ajeet hain | abheet hain | abaah hain | agaah hain | 14 | 42 |","meaning_en":"You are unconquerable, You are fearless, You are unshakeable, You are unfathomable.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[15,43],"number_text":"੧੫। ੪੩।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ। ਨਿਧਾਨ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨੇਕ ਹੈਂ। ਫਿਰਿ ਏਕ ਹੈਂ। ੧੫। ੪੩।","roman":"Amaan hain | nidhaan hain | anek hain | phiri ek hain | 15 | 43 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond measure, You are the treasure, You are many, and yet You are One.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਮਾਨ: read as 'beyond measure' or 'needing no honour'."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,44],"number_text":"੧। ੪੪।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਮਾਨੇ। ਸਮਸਤੀ ਨਿਧਾਨੇ।","roman":"Namo sarab maane | samastee nidhaane |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One honoured by all, the treasure of everything;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਦੇਵ ਦੇਵੇ। ਅਭੇਖੀ ਅਭੇਵੇ। ੧। ੪੪।","roman":"Namo dev deve | abhekhee abheve | 1 | 44 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the God of gods, without garb and beyond all secrets.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,45],"number_text":"੨। ੪੫।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਕਾਲ ਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਪਾਲੇ।","roman":"Namo kaal kaale | namo sarab paale |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Death of death; salutation to the Sustainer of all;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਗਉਣੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭਉਣੇ। ੨। ੪੫।","roman":"Namo sarab gaune | namo sarab bhaune | 2 | 45 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One who goes everywhere; salutation to the One who dwells in every abode.","page":87,"flags":[{"code":"ੋੋ","reason":"same sign typed twice; written once (prints as one)"}],"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,46],"number_text":"੩। ੪੬।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਥੇ। ਨ੍ਰਿਸੰਗੀ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ।","roman":"Anangee anaathe | nrisangee pramaathe |","meaning_en":"Bodiless, without a master, without companions, the Destroyer;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ: the one who crushes (evil)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਭਾਨ ਭਾਨੇ। ਨਮੋ ਮਾਨ ਮਾਨੇ। ੩। ੪੬।","roman":"Namo bhaan bhaane | namo maan maane | 3 | 46 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Sun of suns; salutation to the Honour of the honoured.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,47],"number_text":"੪। ੪੭।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਚੰਦ੍ਰੇ ਚੰਦ੍ਰੇ। ਨਮੋ ਭਾਨ ਭਾਨੇ।","roman":"Namo chandre chandre | namo bhaan bhaane |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Moon of moons; salutation to the Sun of suns;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਗੀਤ ਗੀਤੇ। ਨਮੋ ਤਾਨ ਤਾਨੇ। ੪। ੪੭।","roman":"Namo geet geete | namo taan taane | 4 | 47 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Song of songs; salutation to the Melody of melodies.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤਾਨ: a musical phrase / tune."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,48],"number_text":"੫। ੪੮।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਨ੍ਰਿਤ ਨ੍ਰਿਤੈ। ਨਮੋ ਨਾਦ ਨਾਦੇ।","roman":"Namo nrit nritai | namo naad naade |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Dance of dances; salutation to the Sound of sounds;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨਾਦ: sound, also the unstruck inner sound."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਪਾਨ ਪਾਨੇ। ਨਮੋ ਬਾਦ ਬਾਦੇ। ੫। ੪੮।","roman":"Namo paan paane | namo baad baade | 5 | 48 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Hand of hands; salutation to the Music of musical instruments.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਾਨ ਪਾਨੇ is read as 'hand of hands' (rhythm of the hands, clapping); some read 'the drink of drinks' or 'the life of life'. ਬਾਦ: musical instrument, also read 'debate'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,49],"number_text":"੬। ੪੯।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਮੇ। ਸਮਸਤੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Anangee anaame | samastee saroope |","meaning_en":"Bodiless, nameless, whose form is everything;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਭੰਗੀ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ। ਸਮਸਤੀ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੬। ੪੯।","roman":"Prabhangee pramaathe | samastee bibhoote | 6 | 49 |","meaning_en":"the Destroyer, the Crusher (of evil), whose glory is in everything.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪ੍ਰਭੰਗੀ: destroyer. ਬਿਭੂਤੇ: glory / wealth / power."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,50],"number_text":"੭। ੫੦।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਲੰਕੰ ਬਿਨਾ ਨੇਹਕਲੰਕੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Kalankan binaa nehaklankee saroope |","meaning_en":"Without any stain, Your form is spotless;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਰੂਪੇ। ੭। ੫੦।","roman":"Namo raaj raajesvaran param roope | 7 | 50 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the King of kings, of supreme form.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,51],"number_text":"੮। ੫੧।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਸਿਧੇ।","roman":"Namo jog jogesvaran param sidhe |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Lord of yogis, the supreme Siddha (perfected one);","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਬ੍ਰਿਧੇ। ੮। ੫੧।","roman":"Namo raaj raajesvaran param bridhe | 8 | 51 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the King of kings, the most exalted.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਰਮ ਬ੍ਰਿਧੇ: read as 'supremely great / exalted' or 'most ancient'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,52],"number_text":"੯। ੫੨।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਾਣੇ। ਨਮੋ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਣੇ।","roman":"Namo sasatr paane | namo asatr maane |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One who holds weapons in hand; salutation to the One who wields missiles;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਸਤ੍ਰ: weapons held in the hand (sword etc.); ਅਸਤ੍ਰ: weapons that are thrown or shot (arrows etc.). ਮਾਣੇ: read as 'who wields / honours'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਪਰਮ ਗਿਆਤਾ।ਨਮੋ ਲੋਕ ਮਾਤਾ। ੯। ੫੨।","roman":"Namo param giaataa | namo lok maataa | 9 | 52 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the supreme Knower; salutation to the Mother of the world.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,53],"number_text":"੧੦। ੫੩।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੇਖੀ ਅਭਰਮੀ ਅਭੋਗੀ ਅਭੁਗਤੇ।","roman":"Abhekhee abharmee abhogee abhugte |","meaning_en":"Without garb, free of illusion, not an enjoyer and untouched by enjoyment;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭੁਗਤੇ: one who does not partake (of worldly pleasures)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਜੁਗਤੇ। ੧੦। ੫੩।","roman":"Namo jog jogesvaran param jugte | 10 | 53 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Lord of yogis, of supreme method (yoga).","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਰਮ ਜੁਗਤੇ: of supreme way / discipline; some read 'supremely united'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,54],"number_text":"੧੧। ੫੪।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਨਿਤ ਨਾਰਾਇਣੇਕ੍ਰੂਰ ਕਰਮੇ।","roman":"Namo nit naaraainekroor karme |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the eternal Narayan (Sustainer), and to the One who also does terrible deeds;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"The PDF prints ਨਾਰਾਇਣੇਕ੍ਰੂਰ without a space (read as ਨਾਰਾਇਣੇ ਕ੍ਰੂਰ). ਕ੍ਰੂਰ ਕਰਮੇ: of fearsome (destroying) deeds."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਅਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਦੇਵੇ ਸੁਧਰਮੇ। ੧੧। ੫੪।","roman":"Namo pret apret deve sudharme | 11 | 54 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One who is in spirits and beyond them, to the righteous Lord.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਅਪ੍ਰੇਤ: read as 'in spirits and in what is not spirit'; meaning uncertain. ਸੁਧਰਮੇ: of true righteousness."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[12,55],"number_text":"੧੨। ੫੫।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰੋਗ ਹਰਤਾ। ਨੋਮ ਰਾਗ ਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Namo rog hartaa | nom raag roope |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Remover of disease; salutation to the One whose form is love (music).","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਨੋਮ (kept as printed) where ਨਮੋ is meant. ਰਾਗ: love, or musical mode."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਾਹ ਸਾਹੰ। ਨਮੋ ਭੂਪ ਭੂਪੇ। ੧੨। ੫੫।","roman":"Namo saah saahan | namo bhoop bhoope | 12 | 55 |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the King of kings; salutation to the Ruler of rulers.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13,56],"number_text":"੧੩। ੫੬।","page":87,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਦਾਨੇ ਦਾਨੇ। ਨਮੋ ਮਾਨ ਮਾਨੇ।","roman":"Namo daane daane | namo maan maane |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Giver of givers; salutation to the Honour of the honoured;","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰੋਗ ਰੋਗੇ। ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸਨਾਨੇ। ੧੩। ੫੬।","roman":"Namo rog roge | namastan sanaane | 13 | 56 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Disease of diseases (their destroyer); salutation to the One who is purity itself.","page":87,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰੋਗ ਰੋਗੇ: 'the disease of diseases', i.e. the destroyer of disease. ਸਨਾਨੇ: ablution / bathing, i.e. purity."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[14,57],"number_text":"੧੪। ੫੭।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੰ। ਨਮੋ ਜੰਤ੍ਰ ਜੰਤ੍ਰੰ।","roman":"Namo mantr mantran | namo jantr jantran |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Mantra of mantras; salutation to the Yantra of yantras;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਮੰਤ੍ਰ: sacred formula; ਜੰਤ੍ਰ: mystical diagram."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਇਸਟੇ ਇਸਟੇ। ਨਮੋ ਤੰਤ੍ਰ ਤੰਤ੍ਰੰ। ੧੪। ੫੭।","roman":"Namo iste iste | namo tantr tantran | 14 | 57 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Deity of the worshipped; salutation to the Tantra of tantras.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਇਸਟ: the chosen deity / the one worshipped; ਤੰਤ੍ਰ: ritual practice."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[15,58],"number_text":"੧੫। ੫੮।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਚਿਦਾਨੰਦ ਸਰਬੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ।","roman":"Sadaa sachidaanand sarban pranaasee |","meaning_en":"Ever Truth, Consciousness and Bliss, the Destroyer of all;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਚਿਦਾਨੰਦ: sat-chit-anand, truth-consciousness-bliss."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੂਪੇ ਅਰੂਪੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੀ। ੧੫। ੫੮।","roman":"Anoope aroope samastul nivaasee | 15 | 58 |","meaning_en":"incomparable, formless, dwelling in everything.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[16,59],"number_text":"੧੬।੫੯।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਿਧਿਦਾ ਬੁਧਿਦਾ ਬ੍ਰਿਧਿ ਕਰਤਾ।","roman":"Sadaa sidhidaa budhidaa bridhi kartaa |","meaning_en":"Ever the Giver of spiritual powers and wisdom, and the Bestower of increase;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਿਧਿ: spiritual / supernatural powers, also 'success'. ਬ੍ਰਿਧਿ: growth, prosperity."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਧੋ ਉਰਧ ਅਰਧੰ ਅਘੰ ਓਘ ਹਰਤਾ।੧੬।੫੯।","roman":"Adho uradh ardhan aghan ogh hartaa | 16 | 59 |","meaning_en":"below, above and in between, the Remover of the flood of sins.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਧੋ ਉਰਧ ਅਰਧੰ: below, above and in between (all realms). ਅਘੰ ਓਘ: the mass of sins."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[17,60],"number_text":"੧੭।੬੦।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਪਰਮੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪ੍ਰੋਛਪਾਲੰ।","roman":"Paran param parmesvaran prochhpaalan |","meaning_en":"Beyond the beyond, the supreme Lord, the Sustainer unseen;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪ੍ਰੋਛਪਾਲੰ: read as 'sustainer while unseen (ਪਰੋਖ)'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਰਬਦਾ ਸਿਧਿ ਦਾਤਾ ਦਿਆਲੰ।੧੭।੬੦।","roman":"Sadaa sarabdaa sidhi daataa diaalan | 17 | 60 |","meaning_en":"always and forever the merciful Giver of spiritual powers.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[18,61],"number_text":"੧੮।੬੧।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਛੇਦੀ ਅਭੇਦੀ ਅਨਾਮੰ ਅਕਾਮੰ।","roman":"Achhedee abhedee anaaman akaaman |","meaning_en":"Who cannot be cut, cannot be pierced, nameless and desireless;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮਸਤੋ ਪਰਾਜੀ ਸਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਧਾਮੰ।੧੮।੬੧।","roman":"Samasto paraajee samastastu dhaaman | 18 | 61 |","meaning_en":"Conqueror of all, the abode of everything.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਰਾਜੀ: conqueror. This edition prints ਸਮਸਤਸਤੁ (kept as printed)."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਤੇਰਾ ਜੋਰੁ। ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਤੇਰਾ ਜੋਰੁ। ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Teraa joru | chaachree chhand","meaning_en":"Your power. Chachari metre.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤੇਰਾ ਜੋਰੁ: 'by Your power', a heading in the same sense as 'by Your grace'."},{"type":"verse","number":[1,62],"number_text":"੧। ੬੨।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲੇ ਹੈਂ। ਥਲੇ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੀਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇ ਹੈਂ। ੧। ੬੨।","roman":"Jale hain | thale hain | abheet hain | abhe hain | 1 | 62 |","meaning_en":"You are in the water, You are on the land, You are fearless, You are beyond distinction.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭੇ: read as 'beyond distinction (undivided)' or 'fearless'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,63],"number_text":"੨। ੬੩।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੂ ਹੈਂ। ਅਦੇਸ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇਸ ਹੈਂ। ੨। ੬੩।","roman":"Prabhoo hain | ajoo hain | ades hain | abhes hain | 2 | 63 |","meaning_en":"You are the Lord, You are unborn, You belong to no land, You wear no garb.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜੂ: read as 'unborn' or 'unmoving'."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre. By Your grace.","page":88,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,64],"number_text":"੧। ੬੪।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗਾਧੇ ਅਬਾਧੇ। ਅਨੰਦੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Agaadhe abaadhe | anandee saroope |","meaning_en":"Unfathomable, unhindered, whose form is bliss;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਮਾਨੇ। ਸਮਸਤੀ ਨਿਧਾਨੇ। ੧। ੬੪।","roman":"Namo sarab maane | samastee nidhaane | 1 | 64 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One honoured by all, the treasure of everything.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,65],"number_text":"੨। ੬੫।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਨਾਥੇ। ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ।","roman":"Namastvan nrinaathe | namastvan pramaathe |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, who has no master; salutation to You, the Destroyer;","page":88,"flags":[{"code":"0x50","reason":"subjoined letter typed after the vowel/nasal sign; put in Unicode order (same printed shape)"},{"code":"0x50","reason":"subjoined letter typed after the vowel/nasal sign; put in Unicode order (same printed shape)"}],"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਗੰਜੇ। ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਭੰਜੇ। ੨। ੬੫।","roman":"Namastvan aganje | namastvan abhanje | 2 | 65 |","meaning_en":"salutation to You, the Indestructible; salutation to You, the Unbreakable.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,66],"number_text":"੩। ੬੬।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਕਾਲੇ। ਨਮਸਤ੍ਵੰ ਅਪਾਲੇ।","roman":"Namastvan akaale | namastvan apaale |","meaning_en":"Salutation to You, the Timeless; salutation to You, who needs no sustainer;","page":88,"flags":[{"code":"0x50","reason":"subjoined letter typed after the vowel/nasal sign; put in Unicode order (same printed shape)"}],"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਪਾਲੇ: read as 'needing no sustainer' or 'who sustains without being sustained'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਦੇਸੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੇਸੇ। ੩। ੬੬।","roman":"Namo sarab dese | namo sarab bhese | 3 | 66 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One present in every land; salutation to the One present in every garb.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,67],"number_text":"੪। ੬੭।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਾਜ ਸਾਜੇ।","roman":"Namo raaj raaje | namo saaj saaje |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the King of kings; salutation to the Maker of all makings;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਾਹ ਸਾਹੇ। ਨਮੋ ਮਾਹ ਮਾਹੇ। ੪। ੬੭।","roman":"Namo saah saahe | namo maah maahe | 4 | 67 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Emperor of emperors; salutation to the Moon of moons.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਮਾਹ (Persian): moon; some read 'month' (the Lord of time)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,68],"number_text":"੫। ੬੮।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਗੀਤ ਗੀਤੇ। ਨਮੋ ਪ੍ਰੀਤਿ ਪ੍ਰੀਤੇ।","roman":"Namo geet geete | namo preeti preete |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Song of songs; salutation to the Love of loves;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰੋਖ ਰੋਖੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸੋਖ ਸੋਖੇ। ੫। ੬੮।","roman":"Namo rokh rokhe | namo sokh sokhe | 5 | 68 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Anger of anger; salutation to the One who dries up (consumes) all.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰੋਖ ਰੋਖੇ: 'the wrath of wrath'; ਸੋਖ ਸੋਖੇ: read as 'the drier of drying', i.e. who absorbs everything."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,69],"number_text":"੬। ੬੯।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਰੋਗੇ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੋਗੇ।","roman":"Namo sarab roge | namo sarab bhoge |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One who is in all diseases (and removes them); salutation to the One who is in all enjoyment;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬ ਰੋਗੇ: read as 'destroyer of all disease'; literally 'the disease of all'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਜੀਤੰ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਭੀਤੰ। ੬। ੬੯।","roman":"Namo sarab jeetan | namo sarab bheetan | 6 | 69 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Conqueror of all; salutation to the One feared by all.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,70],"number_text":"੭। ੭੦।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਗਿਆਨੰ। ਨਮੋ ਪਰਮ ਤਾਨੰ।","roman":"Namo sarab giaanan | namo param taanan |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Knowledge of all; salutation to the supreme Power;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤਾਨ: read as 'power / might' here; also 'melody'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੰ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਜੰਤ੍ਰੰ। ੭। ੭੦।","roman":"Namo sarab mantran | namo sarab jantran | 7 | 70 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Mantra of all; salutation to the Yantra of all.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,71],"number_text":"੮। ੭੧।","page":88,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਦ੍ਰਿਸੰ। ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਕ੍ਰਿਸੰ।","roman":"Namo sarab drisan | namo sarab krisan |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Seer of all; salutation to the Attractor of all;","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕ੍ਰਿਸ: read as 'who draws all (to Himself)'; some read 'Krishna' or 'who makes all'. Uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸਰਬ ਰੰਗੇ। ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਅਨੰਗੇ। ੮। ੭੧।","roman":"Namo sarab range | tribhangee anange | 8 | 71 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One in all colours, Destroyer of the three worlds, Bodiless.","page":88,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ: read as 'destroyer of the three worlds' or 'beyond the three qualities'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,72],"number_text":"੯। ੭੨।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੀਵ ਜੀਵੰ। ਨਮੋ ਬੀਜ ਬੀਜੇ।","roman":"Namo jeev jeevan | namo beej beeje |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Life of all life; salutation to the Seed of all seeds;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਖਿਜੇ ਅਭਿਜੇ। ਸਮਸਤੰ ਪ੍ਰਸਿਜੇ। ੯। ੭੨।","roman":"Akhije abhije | samastan prasije | 9 | 72 |","meaning_en":"never vexed, never stained, pleased with everything.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਖਿਜੇ: never irritated / never wasting away. ਅਭਿਜੇ: never soaked (untouched). ਪ੍ਰਸਿਜੇ: read as 'pleased' or 'pervading'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,73],"number_text":"੧੦। ੭੩।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਲੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ। ਕੁਕਰਮੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ।","roman":"Kripaalan saroope | kukarman pranaasee |","meaning_en":"Of merciful form, the Destroyer of evil deeds;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਰਬਦਾ ਰਿਧਿ ਸਿਧੰ ਨਿਵਾਸੀ। ੧੦। ੭੩।","roman":"Sadaa sarabdaa ridhi sidhan nivaasee | 10 | 73 |","meaning_en":"always and forever, the abode of prosperity and spiritual powers.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਿਧਿ ਸਿਧਿ: prosperity and spiritual powers."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਰਪਟ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਰਪਟ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Charpat chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Charpat metre. By Your grace.","page":89,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,74],"number_text":"੧। ੭੪।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਕਰਮੇ। ਅੰਬ੍ਰਿਤ ਧਰਮੇ। ਅਖਿਲ ਜੋਗੇ। ਅਚਲ ਭੋਗੇ। ੧। ੭੪।","roman":"Anmrit karme | anbrit dharme | akhil joge | achal bhoge | 1 | 74 |","meaning_en":"Your deeds are nectar, Your dharma is nectar; You are united with all, an enjoyer who never wavers.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅੰਮ੍ਰਿਤ / ਅੰਬ੍ਰਿਤ: nectar, also 'immortal'. ਅਖਿਲ ਜੋਗੇ: united with all; ਅਚਲ ਭੋਗੇ: of unwavering enjoyment."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,75],"number_text":"੨। ੭੫।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਚਲ ਰਾਜੇ। ਅਟਲ ਸਾਜੇ। ਅਖਲ ਧਰਮੰ। ਅਲਖ ਕਰਮੰ। ੨। ੭੫।","roman":"Achal raaje | atal saaje | akhal dharman | alakh karman | 2 | 75 |","meaning_en":"Your rule is unmoving, Your adornment is eternal; Your dharma is perfect, Your deeds are beyond sight.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਖਲ ਧਰਮੰ: read as 'whose dharma is complete / flawless'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,76],"number_text":"੩। ੭੬।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਦਾਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਗਿਆਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਭਾਨੇ। ਸਰਬੰ ਮਾਨੇ। ੩। ੭੬।","roman":"Sarban daataa | sarban giaataa | sarban bhaane | sarban maane | 3 | 76 |","meaning_en":"Giver to all, Knower of all, Light of all, Honoured by all.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬੰ ਭਾਨੇ: 'the sun (light) of all' or 'who lights all'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,77],"number_text":"੪। ੭੭।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਪ੍ਰਾਣੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਤ੍ਰਾਣੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਭੁਗਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਜੁਗਤਾ। ੪। ੭੭।","roman":"Sarban praanan | sarban traanan | sarban bhugtaa | sarban jugtaa | 4 | 77 |","meaning_en":"The life of all, the strength (protection) of all, the enjoyer in all, united with all.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਾਣੰ: strength, protection."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,78],"number_text":"੫। ੭੮।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਦੇਵੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਭੇਵੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਕਾਲੇ। ਸਰਬੰ ਪਾਲੇ। ੫। ੭੮।","roman":"Sarban devan | sarban bhevan | sarban kaale | sarban paale | 5 | 78 |","meaning_en":"God of all, the secret of all, Death of all, Sustainer of all.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਰੂਆਲ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਰੂਆਲ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Rooaal chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Ruaal metre. By Your grace.","page":89,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,79],"number_text":"੧। ੭੯।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਰੂਪ ਅਨਾਦਿ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਅਜੋਨਿ ਪੁਰਖ ਅਪਾਰ।","roman":"Aadi roop anaadi moorti ajoni purakh apaar |","meaning_en":"The primal Form, the beginningless Image, the unborn, boundless Being;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਮਾਨ ਤ੍ਰਿਮਾਨ ਦੇਵ ਅਭੇਵ ਆਦਿ ਉਦਾਰ।","roman":"Sarab maan trimaan dev abhev aadi udaar |","meaning_en":"honoured by all, revered in the three worlds, the God whose secret none knows, primal and generous;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਪਾਲਕ ਸਰਬ ਘਾਲਕ ਸਰਬ ਕੋ ਪੁਨਿ ਕਾਲ।","roman":"Sarab paalak sarab ghaalak sarab ko puni kaal |","meaning_en":"the Sustainer of all, the Destroyer of all, and again the Death of all;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਤ੍ਰ ਤਤ੍ਰ ਬਿਰਾਜਹੀ ਅਵਧੂਤ ਰੂਪ ਰਿਸਾਲ। ੧। ੭੯।","roman":"Jatr tatr biraajhee avdhoot roop risaal | 1 | 79 |","meaning_en":"He is present here and there, the detached One, of delightful form.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਵਧੂਤ: a renunciate, free of all ties; ਰਿਸਾਲ: delightful / gracious."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,80],"number_text":"੨। ੮੦।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਠਾਮ ਨ ਜਾਤਿ ਜਾਕਰ ਰੂਪ ਰੰਗ ਨ ਰੇਖ।","roman":"Naam thaam na jaati jaakar roop rang na rekh |","meaning_en":"He has no name, no place, no caste; no form, colour or outline;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਪੁਰਖ ਉਦਾਰ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਅਜੋਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਅਸੇਖ।","roman":"Aadi purakh udaar moorti ajoni aadi asekh |","meaning_en":"the primal Being, of generous form, unborn, primal and complete;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਸੇਖ: entire, complete; some read 'without remainder (limitless)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਦੇਸ ਅਉਰ ਨ ਭੇਸ ਜਾਕਰ ਰੂਪ ਰੇਖ ਨ ਰਾਗ।","roman":"Des aur na bhes jaakar roop rekh na raag |","meaning_en":"He has no country and no garb, no form, outline or attachment;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਤ੍ਰ ਤਤ੍ਰ ਦਿਸਾ ਵਿਸਾ ਹੁਇ ਫੈਲਿਓ ਅਨੁਰਾਗ। ੨। ੮੦।","roman":"Jatr tatr disaa visaa hui phailio anuraag | 2 | 80 |","meaning_en":"here and there, in every direction and corner, His love is spread.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਦਿਸਾ ਵਿਸਾ: directions and intermediate directions."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,81],"number_text":"੩। ੮੧।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਾਮ ਕਾਮ ਬਿਹੀਨ ਪੇਖਤ ਧਾਮ ਹੂੰ ਨਹਿ ਜਾਹਿ।","roman":"Naam kaam biheen pekhat dhaam hoon nahi jaahi |","meaning_en":"He is seen to be without name or desire, and He has no particular abode;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਮਾਨ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਨ ਸਦੈਵ ਮਾਨਤ ਤਾਹਿ।","roman":"Sarab maan sarbatr maan sadaiv maanat taahi |","meaning_en":"honoured by all, honoured everywhere, all revere Him always;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਏਕ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਅਨੇਕ ਦਰਸਨ ਕੀਨ ਰੂਪ ਅਨੇਕ।","roman":"Ek moorti anek darsan keen roop anek |","meaning_en":"One form, seen in many ways, He has made many forms;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਖੇਲ ਖੇਲਿ ਅਖੇਲ ਖੇਲਨ ਅੰਤ ਕੋ ਫਿਰਿ ਏਕ। ੩। ੮੧।","roman":"Khel kheli akhel khelan ant ko phiri ek | 3 | 81 |","meaning_en":"having played His play, when He ends the play, in the end He is One again.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,82],"number_text":"੪। ੮੨।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਦੇਵ ਭੇਵ ਨ ਜਾਨਹੀ ਜਿਹ ਬੇਦ ਅਉਰ ਕਤੇਬ।","roman":"Dev bhev na jaanhee jih bed aur kateb |","meaning_en":"The gods do not know His secret, nor do the Vedas and the Semitic books (Katebs);","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਤੇਬ: the Semitic scriptures (Torah, Psalms, Gospel, Quran)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਰੂਪ ਰੰਗ ਨ ਜਾਤਿ ਪਾਤਿ ਸੁ ਜਾਨਈ ਕਿਹ ਜੇਬ।","roman":"Roop rang na jaati paati su jaanaee kih jeb |","meaning_en":"He has no form, colour, caste or lineage; how can anyone know His splendour?","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜੇਬ: beauty, splendour (Persian)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਤਾਤ ਮਾਤ ਨ ਜਾਤ ਜਾ ਕਰ ਜਨਮ ਮਰਨ ਬਿਹੀਨ।","roman":"Taat maat na jaat jaa kar janam maran biheen |","meaning_en":"He has no father, mother or caste; He is free of birth and death;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਕ੍ਰ ਬਕ੍ਰ ਫਿਰੈ ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕਿ ਮਾਨ ਹੀ ਪੁਰ ਤੀਨ। ੪। ੮੨।","roman":"Chakr bakr phirai chatr chaki maan hee pur teen | 4 | 82 |","meaning_en":"His discus turns swiftly through the four directions, and the three worlds honour Him.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਚਕ੍ਰ ਬਕ੍ਰ: read as 'His discus (wheel of command) turns swiftly'; some read 'His command circles everywhere'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,83],"number_text":"੫। ੮੩।","page":89,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਲੋਕ ਚਉਦਹ ਕੇ ਬਿਖੈ ਜਗ ਜਾਪ ਹੀ ਜਿਹ ਜਾਪੁ।","roman":"Lok chaudah ke bikhai jag jaap hee jih jaapu |","meaning_en":"In the fourteen worlds, the world recites His name;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਾਪੁ: the recitation of His name."},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਦਿ ਦੇਵ ਅਨਾਦਿ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਥਾਪਿਓ ਸਬੈ ਜਿਹ ਥਾਪੁ।","roman":"Aadi dev anaadi moorti thaapio sabai jih thaapu |","meaning_en":"the primal God, the beginningless Form, who has established all;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰਮ ਰੂਪ ਪੁਨੀਤ ਮੂਰਤਿ ਪੂਰਨ ਪੁਰਖੁ ਅਪਾਰ।","roman":"Param roop puneet moorti pooran purkhu apaar |","meaning_en":"of supreme form, of pure image, the perfect, boundless Being;","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਬਿਸ੍ਵ ਰਚਿਓ ਸੁਯੰਭਵ ਗੜਨ ਭੰਜਨ ਹਾਰ। ੫। ੮੩।","roman":"Sarab bisv rachio suyanbhav garan bhanjan haar | 5 | 83 |","meaning_en":"Self-existent, He created the whole universe, the Maker and the Breaker.","page":89,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੁਯੰਭਵ: self-existent."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,84],"number_text":"੬। ੮੪।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਾਲ ਹੀਨ ਕਲਾ ਸੰਜੁਗਤਿ ਅਕਾਲ ਪੁਰੁਖ ਅਦੇਸ।","roman":"Kaal heen kalaa sanjugti akaal purukh ades |","meaning_en":"Beyond time, endowed with all power, the Timeless Being belonging to no land;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਲਾ: power; ਅਦੇਸ: without a country."},{"gurmukhi":"ਧਰਮ ਧਾਮ ਸੁ ਭਰਮ ਰਹਤ ਅਭੂਤ ਅਲਖ ਅਭੇਸ।","roman":"Dharam dhaam su bharam rahat abhoot alakh abhes |","meaning_en":"the abode of dharma, free of illusion, not made of the elements, unseen and without garb;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਗ ਰਾਗ ਨ ਰੰਗ ਜਾ ਕਹਿ ਜਾਤਿ ਪਾਤਿ ਨ ਨਾਮ।","roman":"Ang raag na rang jaa kahi jaati paati na naam |","meaning_en":"who has no body, no attachment, no colour, no caste, lineage or name;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅੰਗ ਰਾਗ: read as 'bodily love (attachment)' or 'body and attachment'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਗਰਬ ਗੰਜਨ ਦੁਸਟ ਭੰਜਨ ਮੁਕਤ ਦਾਇਕ ਕਾਮ। ੬। ੮੪।","roman":"Garab ganjan dusat bhanjan mukat daaik kaam | 6 | 84 |","meaning_en":"the Crusher of pride, the Destroyer of the wicked, the Giver of liberation and of what is desired.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਮੁਕਤ ਦਾਇਕ ਕਾਮ: read as 'giver of liberation and of wishes'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,85],"number_text":"੭। ੮੫।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਪ ਰੂਪ ਅਮੀਕ ਅਨਉਸਤਤਿ ਏਕ ਪੁਰਖੁ ਅਵਧੂਤ।","roman":"Aap roop ameek anausatti ek purkhu avdhoot |","meaning_en":"Self-formed, deep beyond measure, beyond all praise, the one detached Being;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਉਸਤਤਿ: beyond praise (no praise can reach Him); some read 'who needs no praise'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਗਰਬ ਗੰਜਨ ਸਰਬ ਭੰਜਨ ਆਦਿ ਰੂਪ ਅਸੂਤ।","roman":"Garab ganjan sarab bhanjan aadi roop asoot |","meaning_en":"the Crusher of pride, the Destroyer of all, the primal Form, unborn;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਸੂਤ: unborn (not begotten)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅੰਗ ਹੀਨ ਅਭੰਗ ਅਨਾਤਮ ਏਕ ਪੁਰਖੁ ਅਪਾਰ।","roman":"Ang heen abhang anaatam ek purkhu apaar |","meaning_en":"without limbs, indestructible, beyond the self, the one boundless Being;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਾਤਮ: read as 'beyond the (individual) self'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਲਾਇਕ ਸਰਬ ਘਾਇਕ ਸਰਬ ਕੋ ਪ੍ਰਤਿਪਾਰ। ੭। ੮੫।","roman":"Sarab laaik sarab ghaaik sarab ko pratipaar | 7 | 85 |","meaning_en":"capable of all, the Destroyer of all, and the Sustainer of all.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,86],"number_text":"੮। ੮੬।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਗੰਤਾ ਸਰਬ ਹੰਤਾ ਸਰਬ ਤੇ ਅਨਭੇਖ।","roman":"Sarab gantaa sarab hantaa sarab te anbhekh |","meaning_en":"He goes to all, He destroys all, and from all He is without garb (distinct);","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬ ਤੇ ਅਨਭੇਖ: read as 'distinct from all, without any garb'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਸਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਨ ਜਾਨਹੀ ਜਿਹ ਰੂਪ ਰੰਗੁ ਅਰੁ ਰੇਖ।","roman":"Sarab saasatr na jaanhee jih roop rangu aru rekh |","meaning_en":"all the Shastras do not know His form, colour and outline;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰਮ ਬੇਦ ਪੁਰਾਣ ਜਾਕਹਿ ਨੇਤਿ ਭਾਖਤ ਨਿਤ।","roman":"Param bed puraan jaakhi neti bhaakhat nit |","meaning_en":"the great Vedas and Puranas always say of Him 'not this';","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕੋਟਿ ਸਿੰਮ੍ਰਿਤਿ ਪੁਰਾਨ ਸਾਸਤ੍ਰ ਨ ਆਵਈ ਵਹੁ ਚਿਤਿ। ੮। ੮੬।","roman":"Koti sinmriti puraan saasatr na aavaee vahu chiti | 8 | 86 |","meaning_en":"He does not come into the mind (understanding) through millions of Smritis, Puranas and Shastras.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਿੰਮ੍ਰਿਤਿ, ਪੁਰਾਨ, ਸਾਸਤ੍ਰ: Hindu scriptures."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਮਧੁਭਾਰ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਮਧੁਭਾਰ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Madhubhaar chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Madhubhaar metre. By Your grace.","page":90,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,87],"number_text":"੧। ੮੭।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗੁਨ ਗਨ ਉਦਾਰ। ਮਹਿਮਾ ਅਪਾਰ।","roman":"Gun gan udaar | mahimaa apaar |","meaning_en":"Generous in Your host of virtues, boundless in Your glory;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਸਨ ਅਭੰਗ। ਉਪਮਾ ਅਨੰਗ। ੧। ੮੭।","roman":"Aasan abhang | upmaa anang | 1 | 87 |","meaning_en":"Your seat is indestructible, Your likeness is beyond the body (beyond comparison).","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਉਪਮਾ ਅਨੰਗ: read as 'whose likeness is bodiless', i.e. beyond any comparison; some read 'more beautiful than Kamdev (Anang, the god of love)'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,88],"number_text":"੨। ੮੮।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਭਉ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ। ਨਿਸ ਦਿਨ ਅਨਾਸ।","roman":"Anbhau prakaas | nis din anaas |","meaning_en":"Light known by inner experience, never perishing, night or day;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਜਾਨੁ ਬਾਹੁ। ਸਾਹਾਨੁ ਸਾਹੁ। ੨। ੮੮।","roman":"Aajaanu baahu | saahaanu saahu | 2 | 88 |","meaning_en":"with arms reaching to the knees, the King of kings.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਜਾਨੁ ਬਾਹੁ: arms reaching to the knees, a traditional sign of greatness."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,89],"number_text":"੩। ੮੯।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਰਾਜਾਨ ਰਾਜ। ਭਾਨਾਨ ਭਾਨੁ।","roman":"Raajaan raaj | bhaanaan bhaanu |","meaning_en":"King of kings, Sun of suns;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਦੇਵਾਨ ਦੇਵ। ਉਪਮਾ ਮਹਾਨ। ੩। ੮੯।","roman":"Devaan dev | upmaa mahaan | 3 | 89 |","meaning_en":"God of gods, of great glory.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,90],"number_text":"੪। ੯੦।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਇੰਦ੍ਰਾਨ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ। ਬਾਲਾਨ ਬਾਲ।","roman":"Indraan indr | baalaan baal |","meaning_en":"Indra of Indras, the Child of children;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਾਲਾਨ ਬਾਲ: read as 'the youngest of the young' or 'the innocence in children'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਰੰਕਾਨ ਰੰਕ। ਕਾਲਾਨ ਕਾਲ। ੪। ੯੦।","roman":"Rankaan rank | kaalaan kaal | 4 | 90 |","meaning_en":"the Pauper of paupers (humblest of the humble), the Death of death.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,91],"number_text":"੫। ੯੧।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਭੂਤ ਅੰਗ। ਆਭਾ ਅਭੰਗ।","roman":"Anbhoot ang | aabhaa abhang |","meaning_en":"His body is not of the elements, His radiance is unbroken;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਗਤਿ ਮਿਤਿ ਅਪਾਰ। ਗੁਨ ਗਨ ਉਦਾਰ। ੫। ੯੧।","roman":"Gati miti apaar | gun gan udaar | 5 | 91 |","meaning_en":"His state and extent are boundless, generous in His host of virtues.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,92],"number_text":"੬। ੯੨।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮੁਨਿ ਗਨ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ। ਨਿਰਭੈ ਨ੍ਰਿਕਾਮ।","roman":"Muni gan pranaam | nirbhai nrikaam |","meaning_en":"Hosts of sages bow to Him; He is fearless and desireless;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਤਿ ਦੁਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਚੰਡ। ਮਿਤਿ ਗਤਿ ਅਖੰਡ। ੬। ੯੨।","roman":"Ati duti prachand | miti gati akhand | 6 | 92 |","meaning_en":"of exceedingly fierce splendour, whose extent and state are undivided.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,93],"number_text":"੭। ੯੩।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਲਿਸ੍ਯ ਕਰਮ। ਆਦ੍ਰਿਸ੍ਯ ਧਰਮ।","roman":"Aalisy karam | aadrisy dharam |","meaning_en":"His deeds are done without effort, His dharma is unseen;","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਲਿਸ੍ਯ ਕਰਮ: read as 'whose deeds are effortless (done as if at leisure)'; some read 'who does not act'. Uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬਾ ਭਰਣਾਢ੍ਯ। ਅਨਡੰਡ ਬਾਢ੍ਯ। ੭। ੯੩।","roman":"Sarbaa bharnaadhy | andand baadhy | 7 | 93 |","meaning_en":"adorned with every ornament, and greater than any punishment can reach.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬਾ ਭਰਣਾਢ੍ਯ: rich in all ornaments. ਅਨਡੰਡ ਬਾਢ੍ਯ: read as 'beyond punishment, ever increasing'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Chaachree chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Chachari metre. By Your grace.","page":90,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,94],"number_text":"੧। ੯੪।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗੁਬਿੰਦੇ। ਮੁਕੰਦੇ। ਉਦਾਰੇ। ਅਪਾਰੇ। ੧। ੯੪।","roman":"Gubinde | mukande | udaare | apaare | 1 | 94 |","meaning_en":"Sustainer of the world (Gobind), Giver of liberation (Mukand), Generous, Boundless.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਗੁਬਿੰਦ: knower / sustainer of the earth. ਮੁਕੰਦ: giver of liberation."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,95],"number_text":"੨। ੯੫।","page":90,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰੀਅੰ। ਕਰੀਅੰ। ਨ੍ਰਿਨਾਮੇ। ਅਕਾਮੇ। ੨। ੯੫।","roman":"Hareean | kareean | nrinaame | akaame | 2 | 95 |","meaning_en":"The Destroyer, the Creator, Nameless, Desireless.","page":90,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰੀਅੰ: read as 'destroyer (remover)' and also 'Hari'; ਕਰੀਅੰ: creator."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,96],"number_text":"੧। ੯੬।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਕਰਤਾ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਹਰਤਾ।","roman":"Chatr chakr kartaa | chatr chakr hartaa |","meaning_en":"Creator of the four directions, Destroyer of the four directions;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ: the four directions, i.e. the whole world."},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਦਾਨੇ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਜਾਨੇ। ੧। ੯੬।","roman":"Chatr chakr daane | chatr chakr jaane | 1 | 96 |","meaning_en":"Giver to the four directions, Knower of the four directions.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,97],"number_text":"੨। ੯੭।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਵਰਤੀ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਭਰਤੀ।","roman":"Chatr chakr vartee | chatr chakr bhartee |","meaning_en":"Ruling the four directions, pervading the four directions;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਚਕ੍ਰ ਵਰਤੀ: universal sovereign."},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਪਾਲੇ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਕਾਲੇ। ੨। ੯੭।","roman":"Chatr chakr paale | chatr chakr kaale | 2 | 97 |","meaning_en":"Sustainer of the four directions, Death of the four directions.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,98],"number_text":"੩। ੯੮।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਪਾਸੇ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਵਾਸੇ।","roman":"Chatr chakr paase | chatr chakr vaase |","meaning_en":"Beside the four directions, dwelling in the four directions;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਮਾਨ੍ਯੈ। ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਦਾਨ੍ਯੈ। ੩। ੯੮।","roman":"Chatr chakr maanyai | chatr chakr daanyai | 3 | 98 |","meaning_en":"honoured in the four directions, Giver to the four directions.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chaachree chhand","meaning_en":"Chachari metre.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,99],"number_text":"੧। ੯੯।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਸਤ੍ਰੈ। ਨ ਮਿਤ੍ਰੈ। ਨ ਭਰਮੰ। ਨ ਭਿਤ੍ਰੈ। ੧। ੯੯।","roman":"Na satrai | na mitrai | na bharman | na bhitrai | 1 | 99 |","meaning_en":"He has no enemy, no friend, no illusion, no fear.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਭਿਤ੍ਰੈ: read as 'fear (ਭੀਤ)'; some read 'nothing within / inside'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,100],"number_text":"੨। ੧੦੦।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਕਰਮੰ। ਨ ਕਾਏ। ਅਜਨਮੰ। ਅਜਾਏ। ੨। ੧੦੦।","roman":"Na karman | na kaae | ajanman | ajaae | 2 | 100 |","meaning_en":"He has no deeds, no body; He is unborn and has no place.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜਾਏ: without a place (ਜਾਇ); also read 'unborn'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,101],"number_text":"੩। ੧੦੧।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਚਿਤ੍ਰੈ। ਨ ਮਿਤ੍ਰੈ। ਪਰੇ ਹੈ। ਪਵਿਤ੍ਰੈ। ੩। ੧੦੧।","roman":"Na chitrai | na mitrai | pare hai | pavitrai | 3 | 101 |","meaning_en":"He has no picture (form), no friend; He is beyond, He is pure.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,102],"number_text":"੪। ੧੦੨।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਿਥੀਸੈ। ਅਦੀਸੈ। ਅਦ੍ਰਿਸੈ। ਅਕ੍ਰਿਸੈ। ੪। ੧੦੨।","roman":"Pritheesai | adeesai | adrisai | akrisai | 4 | 102 |","meaning_en":"Lord of the earth, unseen, invisible, the Attractor of all.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਕ੍ਰਿਸੈ: read as 'beyond attraction' or 'who draws all'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ ਕਥਤੇ","gurmukhi":"ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ ਕਥਤੇ","roman":"Bhagavtee chhand | tvaprasaadi kathte","meaning_en":"Bhagvati metre, spoken by Your grace.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,103],"number_text":"੧। ੧੦੩।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਛਿਜ ਦੇਸੈ। ਕਿ ਆਭਿਜ ਭੇਸੈ।","roman":"Ki aachhij desai | ki aabhij bhesai |","meaning_en":"You are of a land that cannot be destroyed; You are of a garb that cannot be stained;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਛਿਜ: indestructible; ਆਭਿਜ: unsoaked, untouched."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਗੰਜ ਕਰਮੈ। ਕਿ ਆਭੰਜ ਭਰਮੈ। ੧। ੧੦੩।","roman":"Ki aaganj karmai | ki aabhanj bharmai | 1 | 103 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond the reach of deeds; You are free of illusion.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਗੰਜ ਕਰਮੈ: read as 'whose deeds cannot be destroyed' or 'beyond deeds'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,104],"number_text":"੨। ੧੦੪।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਭਿਜ ਲੋਕੈ। ਕਿ ਆਦਿਤ ਸੋਕੈ।","roman":"Ki aabhij lokai | ki aadit sokai |","meaning_en":"You are untouched by the worlds; You are free of sorrow;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਦਿਤ ਸੋਕੈ: read as 'beyond sorrow' or 'who dries up (removes) sorrow like the sun (Aditya)'. Uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਵਧੂਤ ਬਰਨੈ। ਕਿ ਬਿਭੂਤ ਕਰਨੈ। ੨। ੧੦੪।","roman":"Ki avdhoot barnai | ki bibhoot karnai | 2 | 104 |","meaning_en":"You are of detached nature; You are the maker of all glory.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਵਧੂਤ ਬਰਨੈ: of the colour (nature) of a renunciate."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,105],"number_text":"੩। ੧੦੫।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਰਾਜੰ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਧਰਮ ਧੁਜਾ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki raajan prabhaa hain | ki dharam dhujaa hain |","meaning_en":"You are the splendour of kings; You are the banner of dharma;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਸੋਕ ਬਰਨੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਾ ਅਭਰਨੈ। ੩। ੧੦੫।","roman":"Ki aasok barnai | ki sarbaa abharnai | 3 | 105 |","meaning_en":"You are free of sorrow; You are the ornament of all.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬਾ ਅਭਰਨੈ: read as 'the adornment of all' or 'needing no adornment'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,106],"number_text":"੪। ੧੦੬।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਜਗਤੰ ਕ੍ਰਿਤੀ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਛਤ੍ਰੰ ਛਤ੍ਰੀ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki jagtan kritee hain | ki chhatran chhatree hain |","meaning_en":"You are the Creator of the world; You are the bravest of the brave;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਛਤ੍ਰੰ ਛਤ੍ਰੀ: the warrior of warriors; some read 'the canopy (sovereign) of the canopied'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਬ੍ਰਹਮੰ ਸਰੂਪੈ। ਕਿ ਅਨਭਉ ਅਨੂਪੈ। ੪। ੧੦੬।","roman":"Ki brahman saroopai | ki anbhau anoopai | 4 | 106 |","meaning_en":"You are of the form of Brahm; You are incomparable, known through inner experience.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,107],"number_text":"੫। ੧੦੭।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਦਿ ਅਦੇਵ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਆਪਿ ਅਭੇਵ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki aadi adev hain | ki aapi abhev hain |","meaning_en":"You are the primal One, without a god above You; You Yourself are beyond secrets;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਦਿ ਅਦੇਵ: read as 'primal, and Himself not a (mere) god'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਚਿਤ੍ਰੰ ਬਿਹੀਨੈ। ਕਿ ਏਕੈ ਅਧੀਨੈ। ੫। ੧੦੭।","roman":"Ki chitran biheenai | ki ekai adheenai | 5 | 107 |","meaning_en":"You are without any picture (form); You depend on none but Yourself.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਏਕੈ ਅਧੀਨੈ: read as 'subject only to Himself, the One'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,108],"number_text":"੬। ੧੦੮।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਰੋਜੀ ਰਜਾਕੈ। ਰਹੀਮੈ ਰਿਹਾਕੈ।","roman":"Ki rojee rajaakai | raheemai rihaakai |","meaning_en":"You give daily bread, You are the Provider; You are the Merciful, the Liberator;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"Persian / Arabic: ਰੋਜੀ (livelihood), ਰਜਾਕ (provider), ਰਹੀਮ (merciful), ਰਿਹਾਕ (liberator)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਪਾਕ ਬਿਐਬ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਗੈਬੁਲ ਗੈਬ ਹੈਂ। ੬। ੧੦੮।","roman":"Ki paak biaib hain | ki gaibul gaib hain | 6 | 108 |","meaning_en":"You are pure and without fault; You are the Hidden of the hidden.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਾਕ ਬਿਐਬ: pure, without blemish. ਗੈਬੁਲ ਗੈਬ: the unseen of the unseen."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,109],"number_text":"੭। ੧੦੯।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਫਵੁਲ ਗੁਨਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਸਾਹਾਨ ਸਾਹ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki aphvul gunaah hain | ki saahaan saah hain |","meaning_en":"You are the Pardoner of sins; You are the King of kings;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਕਾਰਨ ਕੁਨਿੰਦ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਰੋਜੀ ਦਿਹਿੰਦ ਹੈਂ। ੭। ੧੦੯।","roman":"Ki kaaran kunind hain | ki rojee dihind hain | 7 | 109 |","meaning_en":"You are the Doer of all; You are the Giver of daily bread.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਾਰਨ ਕੁਨਿੰਦ: the doer / cause of all (Persian)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,110],"number_text":"੮। ੧੧੦।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਰਾਜਕ ਰਹੀਮ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਕਰਮੰ ਕਰੀਮ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki raajak raheem hain | ki karman kareem hain |","meaning_en":"You are the merciful Provider; You are the Gracious in Your deeds;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਰਮੰ ਕਰੀਮ: read as 'gracious in deeds' or 'the gracious One of grace'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬੰ ਕਲੀ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬੰ ਦਲੀ ਹੈਂ। ੮। ੧੧੦।","roman":"Ki sarban kalee hain | ki sarban dalee hain | 8 | 110 |","meaning_en":"You are all-powerful; You are the Destroyer of all.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਲੀ: possessing power (ਕਲਾ); ਦਲੀ: who crushes."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,111],"number_text":"੯। ੧੧੧।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਨਿਯੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਦਾਨਿਯੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr maaniyai | ki sarbatr daaniyai |","meaning_en":"You are honoured everywhere; You are the Giver everywhere;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਗਉਨੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭਉਨੈ। ੯। ੧੧੧।","roman":"Ki sarbatr gaunai | ki sarbatr bhaunai | 9 | 111 |","meaning_en":"You go everywhere; You dwell everywhere.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,112],"number_text":"੧੦। ੧੧੨।","page":91,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਦੇਸੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭੇਸੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr desai | ki sarbatr bhesai |","meaning_en":"You are in every land; You are in every garb;","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਰਾਜੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਸਾਜੈ। ੧੦। ੧੧੨।","roman":"Ki sarbatr raajai | ki sarbatr saajai | 10 | 112 |","meaning_en":"You are the King everywhere; You are the Creator everywhere.","page":91,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,113],"number_text":"੧੧। ੧੧੩।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਦੀਨੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਲੀਨੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr deenai | ki sarbatr leenai |","meaning_en":"You are in every faith; You are absorbed in everything;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਦੀਨੈ: read as 'in every faith (ਦੀਨ)' or 'the giver everywhere'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਜਾਹੋ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਹੋ। ੧੧। ੧੧੩।","roman":"Ki sarbatr jaaho | ki sarbatr bhaaho | 11 | 113 |","meaning_en":"You are in every place; You are the light everywhere.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਾਹੋ: place (Persian ਜਾਹ). ਭਾਹੋ: splendour, light."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[12,114],"number_text":"੧੨। ੧੧੪।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਦੇਸੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭੇਸੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr desai | ki sarbatr bhesai |","meaning_en":"You are in every land; You are in every garb;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਕਾਲੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਪਾਲੈ। ੧੨। ੧੧੪।","roman":"Ki sarbatr kaalai | ki sarbatr paalai | 12 | 114 |","meaning_en":"You are the Death of all; You are the Sustainer of all.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13,115],"number_text":"੧੩। ੧੧੫।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਹੰਤਾ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਗੰਤਾ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr hantaa | ki sarbatr gantaa |","meaning_en":"You are the Destroyer of all; You go to all;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭੇਖੀ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਪੇਖੀ। ੧੩। ੧੧੫।","roman":"Ki sarbatr bhekhee | ki sarbatr pekhee | 13 | 115 |","meaning_en":"You wear every garb; You see everything.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[14,116],"number_text":"੧੪। ੧੧੬।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਕਾਜੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਰਾਜੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr kaajai | ki sarbatr raajai |","meaning_en":"You are the Doer of every task; You are the Ruler everywhere;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਸੋਖੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਪੋਖੈ। ੧੪। ੧੧੬।","roman":"Ki sarbatr sokhai | ki sarbatr pokhai | 14 | 116 |","meaning_en":"You dry up (consume) all; You nourish all.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[15,117],"number_text":"੧੫। ੧੧੭।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਤ੍ਰਾਣੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਪ੍ਰਾਣੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr traanai | ki sarbatr praanai |","meaning_en":"You are the strength (protection) of all; You are the life of all;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਦੇਸੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭੇਸੈ। ੧੫। ੧੧੭।","roman":"Ki sarbatr desai | ki sarbatr bhesai | 15 | 117 |","meaning_en":"You are in every land; You are in every garb.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[16,118],"number_text":"੧੬। ੧੧੮।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਨਿਯੈ। ਸਦੈਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਧਾਨਿਯੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr maaniyai | sadaivan pradhaaniyai |","meaning_en":"You are honoured everywhere; You are ever supreme;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਜਾਪਿਯੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਥਾਪਿਯੈ। ੧੬। ੧੧੮।","roman":"Ki sarbatr jaapiyai | ki sarbatr thaapiyai | 16 | 118 |","meaning_en":"You are remembered everywhere; You are established everywhere.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਥਾਪਿਯੈ: read as 'established (installed) everywhere' or 'who establishes all'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[17,119],"number_text":"੧੭। ੧੧੯।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਨੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਨੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbatr bhaanai | ki sarbatr maanai |","meaning_en":"You give light everywhere; You are honoured everywhere;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਇੰਦ੍ਰੈ। ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਚੰਦ੍ਰੈ। ੧੭। ੧੧੯।","roman":"Ki sarbatr indrai | ki sarbatr chandrai | 17 | 119 |","meaning_en":"You are the Indra (ruler) everywhere; You are the moon everywhere.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[18,120],"number_text":"੧੮। ੧੨੦।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬੰ ਕਲੀਮੈ। ਕਿ ਪਰਮੰ ਫਹੀਮੈ।","roman":"Ki sarban kaleemai | ki parman phaheemai |","meaning_en":"You are the Lord of all speech; You are supremely wise;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਲੀਮ (Arabic): one who speaks; read as 'master of speech'. ਫਹੀਮ: wise, understanding."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਕਿਲ ਅਲਾਮੈ। ਕਿ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਲਾਮੈ। ੧੮। ੧੨੦।","roman":"Ki aakil alaamai | ki saahib kalaamai | 18 | 120 |","meaning_en":"You are the wisest and most learned; You are the Master of the Word.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਕਿਲ ਅਲਾਮ: wise and all-knowing. ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਲਾਮ: master of the (divine) word / language."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[19,121],"number_text":"੧੯। ੧੨੧।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਹੁਸਨਲ ਵਜੂ ਹੈਂ। ਤਮਾਮੁਲ ਰੁਜੂ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki husnal vajoo hain | tamaamul rujoo hain |","meaning_en":"You are the beauty of form; all turn to You;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹੁਸਨਲ ਵਜੂ: beauty of countenance. ਤਮਾਮੁਲ ਰੁਜੂ: the one to whom all turn."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਸਲਾਮੈ। ਸਲੀਖਤ ਮੁਦਾਮੈ। ੧੯। ੧੨੧।","roman":"Hamesul salaamai | saleekhat mudaamai | 19 | 121 |","meaning_en":"You are ever in peace; You are ever the support.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਸਲਾਮ: ever at peace / ever saluted. ਸਲੀਖਤ ਮੁਦਾਮ: read as 'ever composed' or 'ever the support (of all)'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[20,122],"number_text":"੨੦। ੧੨੨।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗਨੀਮੁਲ ਸਿਕਸਤੈ। ਗਰੀਬੁਲ ਪਰਸਤੈ।","roman":"Ganeemul sikastai | gareebul parastai |","meaning_en":"You are the Defeater of enemies; You are the Protector of the poor;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਗਨੀਮੁਲ ਸਿਕਸਤ: who defeats the foe. ਗਰੀਬੁਲ ਪਰਸਤ: who cherishes the poor."},{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਲੰਦੁਲ ਮਕਾਨੈ। ਜਮੀਨਲ ਜਮਾਨੈ। ੨੦। ੧੨੨।","roman":"Bilandul makaanai | jameenal jamaanai | 20 | 122 |","meaning_en":"Your abode is the highest; You pervade the earth and the heavens.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਿਲੰਦੁਲ ਮਕਾਨ: of exalted abode. ਜਮੀਨਲ ਜਮਾਨ: read as 'in earth and sky' or 'in the earth and in time'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[21,123],"number_text":"੨੧। ੧੨੩।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤਮੀਜੁਲ ਤਮਾਮੈ। ਰੁਜੂਅਲ ਨਿਧਾਨੈ।","roman":"Tameejul tamaamai | rujooal nidhaanai |","meaning_en":"You discern all; You are the treasure to whom all turn;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤਮੀਜੁਲ ਤਮਾਮ: who distinguishes all. ਰੁਜੂਅਲ ਨਿਧਾਨ: the treasure to whom all turn."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰੀਫੁਲ ਅਜੀਮੈ। ਰਜਾਇਕ ਯਕੀਨੈ। ੨੧। ੧੨੩।","roman":"Hareephul ajeemai | rajaaik yakeenai | 21 | 123 |","meaning_en":"You are the great Friend; You are surely the Provider.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰੀਫੁਲ ਅਜੀਮ: read as 'the great companion' or 'the great adversary (of the wicked)'. ਰਜਾਇਕ ਯਕੀਨ: certainly the provider."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[22,124],"number_text":"੨੨। ੧੨੪।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੇਕੁਲ ਤਰੰਗ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇਦ ਹੈਂ ਅਭੰਗ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Anekul tarang hain | abhed hain abhang hain |","meaning_en":"You are many waves (of one ocean); You are undivided and indestructible;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜੀਜਲ ਨਿਵਾਜ ਹੈਂ। ਗਨੀਮੁਲ ਖਿਰਾਜ ਹੈਂ। ੨੨। ੧੨੪।","roman":"Ajeejal nivaaj hain | ganeemul khiraaj hain | 22 | 124 |","meaning_en":"You honour Your loved ones; You take tribute from enemies.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜੀਜਲ ਨਿਵਾਜ: who favours the beloved. ਗਨੀਮੁਲ ਖਿਰਾਜ: who exacts tribute from the foe."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[23,125],"number_text":"੨੩। ੧੨੫।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਰੁਕਤ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਤ੍ਰਿਮੁਕਤਿ ਬਿਭੂਤਿ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Nirukat saroop hain | trimukti bibhooti hain |","meaning_en":"Your form is beyond description; Your glory is beyond the three qualities;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨਿਰੁਕਤ: beyond words. ਤ੍ਰਿਮੁਕਤਿ: read as 'free of the three qualities (gunas)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਭੁਗਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ। ਸੁਜੁਗਤਿ ਸੁਧਾ ਹੈਂ। ੨੩। ੧੨੫।","roman":"Prabhugti prabhaa hain | sujugti sudhaa hain | 23 | 125 |","meaning_en":"Your splendour is mighty; You are the nectar of perfect union.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪ੍ਰਭੁਗਤਿ: read as 'powerful / all-enjoying'; ਸੁਜੁਗਤਿ ਸੁਧਾ: nectar of right union. Uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[24,126],"number_text":"੨੪। ੧੨੬।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦੈਵੰ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇਦੀ ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Sadaivan saroop hain | abhedee anoop hain |","meaning_en":"You are of eternal form; You are undivided and incomparable;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮਸਤੋਪਰਾਜ ਹੈਂ। ਸਦਾ ਸਰਬ ਸਾਜ ਹੈਂ। ੨੪। ੧੨੬।","roman":"Samastopraaj hain | sadaa sarab saaj hain | 24 | 126 |","meaning_en":"You are the Conqueror (King) of all; You are ever the Maker of all.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਮਸਤੋਪਰਾਜ: read as 'king over all' or 'conqueror of all'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[25,127],"number_text":"੨੫। ੧੨੭।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਸਲਾਮ ਹੈਂ। ਸਦੈਵੁਲ ਅਕਾਮ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Samastul salaam hain | sadaivul akaam hain |","meaning_en":"You are the peace (salutation) of all; You are ever desireless;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਧ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਗਾਧ ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ੨੫। ੧੨੭।","roman":"Nribaadh saroop hain | agaadh anoop hain | 25 | 127 |","meaning_en":"Your form is unhindered; You are unfathomable and incomparable.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[26,128],"number_text":"੨੬। ੧੨੮।","page":92,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਓਅੰ ਆਦਿ ਰੂਪੇ। ਅਨਾਦਿ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Oan aadi roope | anaadi saroope |","meaning_en":"Om, the primal Form; of beginningless form;","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਓਅੰ: the sacred syllable Om, the One."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਮੇ। ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ। ੨੬। ੧੨੮।","roman":"Anangee anaame | tribhangee trikaame | 26 | 128 |","meaning_en":"bodiless and nameless, Destroyer of the three worlds, fulfiller of the three desires.","page":92,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ: uncertain; read as 'destroyer of the three worlds' and 'fulfiller of the three aims / desires'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[27,129],"number_text":"੨੭। ੧੨੯।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਬਰਗੰ ਤ੍ਰਿਬਾਧੇ। ਅਗੰਜੇ ਅਗਾਧੇ।","roman":"Tribargan tribaadhe | aganje agaadhe |","meaning_en":"Giver of the three aims of life, free of the three afflictions, indestructible, unfathomable;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਬਾਧੇ: read as 'unhindered in the three worlds' or 'free of the three afflictions'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਭੰ ਸਰਬ ਭਾਗੇ। ਸੁ ਸਰਬਾਨੁਰਾਗੇ। ੨੭। ੧੨੯।","roman":"Subhan sarab bhaage | su sarbaanuraage | 27 | 129 |","meaning_en":"of good fortune in everything, loving towards all.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[28,130],"number_text":"੨੮। ੧੩੦।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੁਗਤ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਛਿਜ ਹੈਂ ਅਛੂਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Tribhugat saroop hain | achhij hain achhoot hain |","meaning_en":"Your form enjoys the three worlds; You cannot be cut, You cannot be touched;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੁਗਤ: enjoyer of the three worlds."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਨਰਕੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਪ੍ਰਿਥੀਉਲ ਪ੍ਰਵਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ੨੮। ੧੩੦।","roman":"Ki narkan pranaas hain | pritheeul pravaas hain | 28 | 130 |","meaning_en":"You are the destroyer of hell; You dwell throughout the earth.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[29,131],"number_text":"੨੯। ੧੩੧।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਰੁਕਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ। ਸਦੈਵੰ ਸਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Nirukti prabhaa hain | sadaivan sadaa hain |","meaning_en":"Your splendour is beyond words; You are ever and always;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਭੁਗਤਿ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਪ੍ਰਜੁਗਤਿ ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ੨੯। ੧੩੧।","roman":"Bibhugti saroop hain | prajugti anoop hain | 29 | 131 |","meaning_en":"Your form is present in all enjoyment; You are incomparable in union.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਿਭੁਗਤਿ: read as 'present in all things (all-enjoying)'. ਪ੍ਰਜੁਗਤਿ: united with all. Uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[30,132],"number_text":"੩੦। ੧੩੨।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਰੁਕਤਿ ਸਦਾ ਹੈਂ। ਬਿਭੁਗਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Nirukti sadaa hain | bibhugti prabhaa hain |","meaning_en":"You are ever beyond words; Your splendour is in all things;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਉਕਤਿ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਪ੍ਰਜੁਗਤਿ ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ੩੦। ੧੩੨।","roman":"Anaukti saroop hain | prajugti anoop hain | 30 | 132 |","meaning_en":"Your form cannot be spoken; You are incomparable in union.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਾਚਰੀ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Chaachree chhand","meaning_en":"Chachari metre.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,133],"number_text":"੧। ੧੩੩।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੰਗ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨੰਗ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Abhang hain | anang hain |","meaning_en":"You are indestructible; You are bodiless;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ਅਲੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ੧। ੧੩੩।","roman":"Abhekh hain | alekh hain | 1 | 133 |","meaning_en":"You wear no garb; You are beyond account.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,134],"number_text":"੨। ੧੩੪।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭਰਮ ਹੈਂ। ਅਕਰਮ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Abhram hain | akram hain |","meaning_en":"You are free of illusion; You are beyond deeds;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ਜੁਗਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ੨। ੧੩੪।","roman":"Anaadi hain | jugaadi hain | 2 | 134 |","meaning_en":"You are without beginning; You are from the beginning of the ages.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,135],"number_text":"੩। ੧੩੫।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜੈ ਹੈਂ। ਅਬੈ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ajai hain | abai hain |","meaning_en":"You are unconquerable; You are imperishable;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਬੈ: read as 'imperishable' (without decay, ਬੈ / ਵ੍ਯਯ) or 'without age'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੂਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਧੂਤ ਹੈਂ। ੩। ੧੩੫।","roman":"Abhoot hain | adhoot hain | 3 | 135 |","meaning_en":"You are not made of the elements; You are unshakeable.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਧੂਤ: read as 'unshakeable' or 'stainless'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,136],"number_text":"੪। ੧੩੬।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਉਦਾਸ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Anaas hain | udaas hain |","meaning_en":"You are imperishable; You are detached;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਧੰਧ ਹੈਂ। ਅਬੰਧ ਹੈਂ। ੪। ੧੩੬।","roman":"Adhandh hain | abandh hain | 4 | 136 |","meaning_en":"You are free of worldly affairs; You are unbound.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,137],"number_text":"੫। ੧੩੭।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭਗਤ ਹੈਂ। ਬਿਰਕਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Abhgat hain | birkat hain |","meaning_en":"You are devoted to none (dependent on none); You are free of attachment;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭਗਤ: read as 'not a devotee of anyone', i.e. dependent on none; some read 'beyond (the need of) devotion'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ੫। ੧੩੭।","roman":"Anaas hain | prakaas hain | 5 | 137 |","meaning_en":"You are imperishable; You are light itself.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,138],"number_text":"੬। ੧੩੮।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਚਿੰਤ ਹੈਂ। ਸੁਨਿੰਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Nichint hain | sunint hain |","meaning_en":"You are free of worry; You are good (beyond praise);","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸੁਨਿੰਤ: read as 'good / well-praised'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲਿਖ ਹੈਂ। ਅਦਿਖ ਹੈਂ। ੬। ੧੩੮।","roman":"Alikh hain | adikh hain | 6 | 138 |","meaning_en":"You cannot be written; You cannot be seen.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,139],"number_text":"੭। ੧੩੯।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਲੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ਅਭੇਖ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Alekh hain | abhekh hain |","meaning_en":"You are beyond account; You wear no garb;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਢਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ਅਗਾਹ ਹੈਂ। ੭। ੧੩੯।","roman":"Adhaah hain | agaah hain | 7 | 139 |","meaning_en":"You cannot be toppled; You are unfathomable.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,140],"number_text":"੮। ੧੪੦।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਸੰਭ ਹੈਂ। ਅਗੰਭ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Asanbh hain | aganbh hain |","meaning_en":"You are not born; You are deep beyond measure;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਗੰਭ: read as 'of unfathomable depth' (ਗੰਭੀਰ)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੀਲ ਹੈਂ। ਅਨਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ੮। ੧੪੦।","roman":"Aneel hain | anaadi hain | 8 | 140 |","meaning_en":"You are colourless; You are without beginning.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,141],"number_text":"੯। ੧੪੧।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਸੁਨਿਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Anit hain | sunit hain |","meaning_en":"You are beyond the transient; You are eternal;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਿਤ ਹੈਂ ਸੁਨਿਤ ਹੈਂ: read as 'You are (also present in) the transient, and You are the eternal'; the exact sense is debated."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜਾਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜਾਦਿ ਹੈਂ। ੯। ੧੪੧।","roman":"Ajaat hain | ajaadi hain | 9 | 141 |","meaning_en":"You have no caste; You are free and unborn.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਚਰਪਟ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਚਰਪਟ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Charpat chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Charpat metre. By Your grace.","page":93,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,142],"number_text":"੧। ੧੪੨।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਹੰਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਗੰਤਾ।","roman":"Sarban hantaa | sarban gantaa |","meaning_en":"Destroyer of all, going to all;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਖਿਆਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਗਿਆਤਾ। ੧। ੧੪੨।","roman":"Sarban khiaataa | sarban giaataa | 1 | 142 |","meaning_en":"renowned among all, the Knower of all.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,143],"number_text":"੨। ੧੪੩ ।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਹਰਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਕਰਤਾ।","roman":"Sarban hartaa | sarban kartaa |","meaning_en":"Destroyer of all, Creator of all;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਪ੍ਰਾਣੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਤ੍ਰਾਣੰ। ੨। ੧੪੩ ।","roman":"Sarban praanan | sarban traanan | 2 | 143 |","meaning_en":"the life of all, the strength of all.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,144],"number_text":"੩। ੧੪੪।","page":93,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਕਰਮੰ। ਸਰਬੰ ਧਰਮੰ।","roman":"Sarban karman | sarban dharman |","meaning_en":"In all deeds, in every dharma;","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਜੁਗਤਾ। ਸਰਬੰ ਮੁਕਤਾ। ੩। ੧੪੪।","roman":"Sarban jugtaa | sarban muktaa | 3 | 144 |","meaning_en":"united with all, yet free of all.","page":93,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਰਸਾਵਲ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਰਸਾਵਲ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Rasaaval chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Rasaaval metre. By Your grace.","page":94,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,145],"number_text":"੧। ੧੪੫।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਨਰਕ ਨਾਸੇ। ਸਦੈਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸੇ।","roman":"Namo narak naase | sadaivan prakaase |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Destroyer of hell, ever shining;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੰਗੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ। ਅਭੰਗੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੧। ੧੪੫।","roman":"Anangan saroope | abhangan bibhoote | 1 | 145 |","meaning_en":"of bodiless form, of indestructible glory.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,146],"number_text":"੨। ੧੪੬।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੰ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ। ਸਦਾ ਸਰਬ ਸਾਥੇ।","roman":"Pramaathan pramaathe | sadaa sarab saathe |","meaning_en":"Crusher of the crushers, ever with all;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗਾਧ ਸਰੂਪੇ। ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਧ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੨। ੧੪੬।","roman":"Agaadh saroope | nribaadh bibhoote | 2 | 146 |","meaning_en":"of unfathomable form, of unhindered glory.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,147],"number_text":"੩। ੧੪੭।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਮੇ। ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ।","roman":"Anangee anaame | tribhangee trikaame |","meaning_en":"Bodiless and nameless, Destroyer of the three worlds, fulfiller of the three desires;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਮੇ: see the same words in verse 128."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ। ਸਰਬੰਗੀ ਅਨੂਪੇ। ੩। ੧੪੭।","roman":"Nribhangee saroope | sarbangee anoope | 3 | 147 |","meaning_en":"of indestructible form, present in all, incomparable.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬੰਗੀ: present in all bodies / having all parts."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,148],"number_text":"੪। ੧੪੮।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਪੋਤ੍ਰੈ ਨ ਪੁਤ੍ਰੈ। ਨ ਸਤ੍ਰੈ ਨ ਮਿਤ੍ਰੈ।","roman":"Na potrai na putrai | na satrai na mitrai |","meaning_en":"He has no grandson, no son, no enemy, no friend;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਤਾਤੈ ਨ ਮਾਤੈ। ਨ ਜਾਤੈ ਨ ਪਾਤੈ। ੪। ੧੪੮।","roman":"Na taatai na maatai | na jaatai na paatai | 4 | 148 |","meaning_en":"no father, no mother, no caste, no lineage.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,149],"number_text":"੫। ੧੪੯।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਸਾਕੰ ਸਰੀਕ ਹੈਂ। ਅਮਿਤੋ ਅਮੀਕ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Nrisaakan sareek hain | amito ameek hain |","meaning_en":"Without kin or rival, boundless and deep beyond measure;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਨ੍ਰਿਸਾਕੰ ਸਰੀਕ: read as 'without kin and without partner (rival)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦੈਵੰ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ। ਅਜੈ ਹੈਂ ਅਜਾ ਹੈਂ। ੫। ੧੪੯।","roman":"Sadaivan prabhaa hain | ajai hain ajaa hain | 5 | 149 |","meaning_en":"ever radiant, unconquerable and unborn.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭਗਵਤੀ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Bhagavtee chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Bhagvati metre. By Your grace.","page":94,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,150],"number_text":"੧। ੧੫੦।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਜਾਹਿਰ ਜਹੂਰ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਹਾਜਿਰ ਹਜੂਰ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki jaahir jahoor hain | ki haajir hajoor hain |","meaning_en":"You are manifest in Your manifestation; You are present everywhere;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਾਹਿਰ ਜਹੂਰ: manifest of the manifest. ਹਾਜਿਰ ਹਜੂਰ: ever present before us."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਸਲਾਮ ਹੈਂ। ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਕਲਾਮ ਹੈਂ। ੧। ੧੫੦।","roman":"Hamesul salaam hain | samastul kalaam hain | 1 | 150 |","meaning_en":"You are ever peace; You are the word of all.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਕਲਾਮ: present in all speech / praised in all speech."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,151],"number_text":"੨। ੧੫੧।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਦਿਮਾਗ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਹੁਸਨੁਲ ਚਰਾਗ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki saahib dimaag hain | ki husnul charaag hain |","meaning_en":"You are the master of intellect; You are the lamp of beauty;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਾਹਿਬ ਦਿਮਾਗ: master of the mind / of great understanding."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਕਾਮਲ ਕਰੀਮ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਰਾਜਕ ਰਹੀਮ ਹੈਂ। ੨। ੧੫੧।","roman":"Ki kaamal kareem hain | ki raajak raheem hain | 2 | 151 |","meaning_en":"You are perfect and gracious; You are the merciful Provider.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,152],"number_text":"੩। ੧੫੨।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਰੋਜੀ ਦਿਹਿੰਦ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਰਾਜਕ ਰਹਿੰਦ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki rojee dihind hain | ki raajak rahind hain |","meaning_en":"You are the Giver of daily bread; You are the ever-living Provider;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਹਿੰਦ: read as 'ever abiding' or 'who frees (from bondage)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰੀਮੁਲ ਕਮਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਹੁਸਨੁਲ ਜਮਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ੩। ੧੫੨।","roman":"Kareemul kamaal hain | ki husnul jamaal hain | 3 | 152 |","meaning_en":"You are perfect in grace; You are the beauty of loveliness.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,153],"number_text":"੪। ੧੫੩।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਗਨੀਮੁਲ ਖਿਰਾਜ ਹੈਂ। ਗਰੀਬੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਜ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ganeemul khiraaj hain | gareebul nivaaj hain |","meaning_en":"You take tribute from enemies; You cherish the poor;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਗਰੀਬੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਜ: who favours the humble."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰੀਫੁਲ ਸਿਕੰਨ ਹੈਂ। ਹਿਰਾਸੁਲ ਫਿਕੰਨ ਹੈਂ। ੪। ੧੫੩।","roman":"Hareephul sikann hain | hiraasul phikann hain | 4 | 153 |","meaning_en":"You break the adversary; You remove fear.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰੀਫੁਲ ਸਿਕੰਨ: breaker of the foe. ਹਿਰਾਸੁਲ ਫਿਕੰਨ: who casts away fear."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,154],"number_text":"੫। ੧੫੪।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਲੰਕੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Kalankan pranaas hain | samastul nivaas hain |","meaning_en":"You destroy stains (sins); You dwell in everything;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਜੁਲ ਗਨੀਮ ਹੈਂ। ਰਜਾਇਕ ਰਹੀਮ ਹੈ। ੫। ੧੫੪।","roman":"Aganjul ganeem hain | rajaaik raheem hai | 5 | 154 |","meaning_en":"You are the One whom no enemy can destroy; You are the merciful Provider.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,155],"number_text":"੬। ੧੫੫।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਜੁਬਾਂ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਿਰਾ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Samastul jubaan hain | ki saahib kiraa hain |","meaning_en":"You are the tongue (speech) of all; You are the Lord of greatness;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਿਰਾ: read as 'master of dignity / greatness' (Persian); uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਨਰਕੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਬਹਿਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ੬। ੧੫੫।","roman":"Ki narkan pranaas hain | bahistul nivaas hain | 6 | 155 |","meaning_en":"You destroy hell; You dwell in heaven.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,156],"number_text":"੭। ੧੫੬।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬੁਲ ਗਵੰਨ ਹੈਂ। ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਰਵੰਨ ਹੈ।","roman":"Ki sarbul gavann hain | hamesul ravann hai |","meaning_en":"You go to all; You are ever enjoying (present);","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਰਵੰਨ: ever moving / ever pervading."},{"gurmukhi":"ਤਮਾਮੁਲ ਤਮੀਜ ਹੈਂ। ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਅਜੀਜ ਹੈਂ। ੭। ੧੫੬।","roman":"Tamaamul tameej hain | samastul ajeej hain | 7 | 156 |","meaning_en":"You discern all; You are dear to all.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,157],"number_text":"੮। ੧੫੭।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਈਸ ਹੈਂ। ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਅਦੀਸ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Paran param ees hain | samastul adees hain |","meaning_en":"You are the Lord beyond the beyond; You are unseen by all;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਦੇਸੁਲ ਅਲੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ਹਮੇਸੁਲ ਅਭੇਖ ਹੈਂ। ੮। ੧੫੭।","roman":"Adesul alekh hain | hamesul abhekh hain | 8 | 157 |","meaning_en":"You belong to no land and are beyond account; You are ever without garb.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,158],"number_text":"੯। ੧੫੮।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਮੀਨੁਲ ਜਮਾਂ ਹੈਂ। ਅਮੀਕੁਲ ਇਮਾਂ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Jameenul jamaan hain | ameekul imaan hain |","meaning_en":"You are in the earth and the heavens; You are the deepest faith;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਮੀਕੁਲ ਇਮਾਂ: read as 'of deep faith / the deep faith itself'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰੀਮੁਲ ਕਮਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਜੁਰਅਤ ਜਮਾਲ ਹੈਂ। ੯। ੧੫੮।","roman":"Kareemul kamaal hain | ki jura'at jamaal hain | 9 | 158 |","meaning_en":"You are perfect in grace; You are courage and beauty.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜੁਰਅਤ ਜਮਾਲ: courage and beauty, or 'of courageous beauty'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,159],"number_text":"੧੦। ੧੫੯।","page":94,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਚਲੰ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਅਮਿਤੋ ਸੁਬਾਸ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki achlan prakaas hain | ki amito subaas hain |","meaning_en":"You are unwavering light; You are boundless fragrance;","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਜਬ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਅਮਿਤੋ ਬਿਭੂਤਿ ਹੈਂ। ੧੦। ੧੫੯।","roman":"Ki ajab saroop hain | ki amito bibhooti hain | 10 | 159 |","meaning_en":"You are of wondrous form; You are of boundless glory.","page":94,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,160],"number_text":"੧੧। ੧੬੦।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਮਿਤੋ ਪਸਾ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਆਤਮ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ki amito pasaa hain | ki aatam prabhaa hain |","meaning_en":"You are of boundless expanse; You are self-radiant;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਸਾ: expanse (ਪਸਾਰਾ)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਚਲੰ ਅਨੰਗ ਹੈਂ। ਕਿ ਅਮਿਤੋ ਅਭੰਗ ਹੈਂ। ੧੧। ੧੬੦।","roman":"Ki achlan anang hain | ki amito abhang hain | 11 | 160 |","meaning_en":"You are unmoving and bodiless; You are boundless and indestructible.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਮਧੁਭਾਰ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਮਧੁਭਾਰ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Madhubhaar chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Madhubhaar metre. By Your grace.","page":95,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,161],"number_text":"੧। ੧੬੧।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਮੁਨਿ ਮਨਿ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ। ਗੁਨਿ ਗਨ ਮੁਦਾਮ।","roman":"Muni mani pranaam | guni gan mudaam |","meaning_en":"Sages bow to You in their minds; You are ever the treasure of virtues;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਗੁਨਿ ਗਨ ਮੁਦਾਮ: read as 'ever (the abode of) hosts of virtues'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਰਿ ਬਰ ਅਗੰਜ। ਹਰਿ ਨਰ ਪ੍ਰਭੰਜ। ੧। ੧੬੧।","roman":"Ari bar aganj | hari nar prabhanj | 1 | 161 |","meaning_en":"invincible by the mightiest enemies, Destroyer of all beings.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਹਰਿ ਨਰ ਪ੍ਰਭੰਜ: read as 'destroyer of all (gods and humans)'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,162],"number_text":"੨। ੧੬੨।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨ ਗਨ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ। ਮੁਨਿ ਮਨਿ ਸਲਾਮ।","roman":"An gan pranaam | muni mani salaam |","meaning_en":"Countless beings bow to You; sages salute You in their minds;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰਿ ਨਰ ਅਖੰਡ। ਬਰ ਨਰ ਅਮੰਡ। ੨। ੧੬੨।","roman":"Hari nar akhand | bar nar amand | 2 | 162 |","meaning_en":"unbroken among gods and humans; the best of beings, never fashioned (by anyone).","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਮੰਡ: not established by another. The line is read in several ways."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,163],"number_text":"੩। ੧੬੩।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਭਵ ਅਨਾਸ। ਮੁਨਿ ਮਨਿ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ।","roman":"Anbhav anaas | muni mani prakaas |","meaning_en":"Known by inner experience, imperishable, the light in the minds of sages;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਗੁਨਿ ਗਨ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ। ਜਲ ਥਲ ਮੁਦਾਮ। ੩। ੧੬੩।","roman":"Guni gan pranaam | jal thal mudaam | 3 | 163 |","meaning_en":"the virtuous bow to You; You are ever present in water and on land.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,164],"number_text":"੪। ੧੬੪।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਛਿਜ ਅੰਗ। ਆਸਨ ਅਭੰਗ।","roman":"Anchhij ang | aasan abhang |","meaning_en":"Your body cannot be cut; Your seat is indestructible;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਉਪਮਾ ਅਪਾਰ। ਗਤਿ ਮਿਤਿ ਉਦਾਰ। ੪। ੧੬੪।","roman":"Upmaa apaar | gati miti udaar | 4 | 164 |","meaning_en":"Your glory is boundless; Your state and extent are vast.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,165],"number_text":"੫। ੧੬੫।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲ ਥਲ ਅਮੰਡ। ਦਿਸ ਵਿਸ ਅਭੰਡ।","roman":"Jal thal amand | dis vis abhand |","meaning_en":"Unfashioned in water and on land, unbounded in every direction;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭੰਡ: read as 'beyond reproach' or 'unbounded'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਜਲ ਥਲ ਮਹੰਤ। ਦਿਸ ਵਿਸ ਬਿਅੰਤ। ੫। ੧੬੫।","roman":"Jal thal mahant | dis vis biant | 5 | 165 |","meaning_en":"great in water and on land, infinite in every direction.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,166],"number_text":"੬। ੧੬੬।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਭਵ ਅਨਾਸ। ਧ੍ਰਿਤ ਧਰ ਧੁਰਾਸ।","roman":"Anbhav anaas | dhrit dhar dhuraas |","meaning_en":"Known by inner experience, imperishable, the upholder of the earth's foundation;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਧ੍ਰਿਤ ਧਰ ਧੁਰਾਸ: read as 'the patient (steadfast) supporter at the root of all'; uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਜਾਨ ਬਾਹੁ। ਏਕੈ ਸਦਾਹੁ। ੬। ੧੬੬।","roman":"Aajaan baahu | ekai sadaahu | 6 | 166 |","meaning_en":"with arms reaching to the knees, ever the One.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,167],"number_text":"੭। ੧੬੭।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਓਅੰਕਾਰ ਆਦਿ। ਕਥਨੀ ਅਨਾਦਿ।","roman":"Oankaar aadi | kathnee anaadi |","meaning_en":"Oankaar, the primal One, whose story has no beginning;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਥਨੀ ਅਨਾਦਿ: read as 'whose account is without beginning'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਖਲ ਖੰਡ ਖਿਆਲ। ਗੁਰ ਬਰ ਅਕਾਲ। ੭। ੧੬੭।","roman":"Khal khand khiaal | gur bar akaal | 7 | 167 |","meaning_en":"who destroys the wicked in a moment of thought, the great Guru, the Timeless.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਖਲ ਖੰਡ ਖਿਆਲ: who destroys the wicked by a mere thought."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,168],"number_text":"੮। ੧੬੮।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਘਰਿ ਘਰਿ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮ। ਚਿਤ ਚਰਨ ਨਾਮ।","roman":"Ghari ghari pranaam | chit charan naam |","meaning_en":"In every home You are bowed to; in the mind are Your feet and Your name;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਛਿਜ ਗਾਤ। ਆਜਿਜ ਨ ਬਾਤ। ੮। ੧੬੮।","roman":"Anchhij gaat | aajij na baat | 8 | 168 |","meaning_en":"Your body cannot be cut; You are never helpless in anything.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਆਜਿਜ ਨ ਬਾਤ: read as 'never weak / helpless in any matter' (Persian aajiz, helpless)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,169],"number_text":"੯। ੧੬੯।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਝੰਝ ਗਾਤ। ਅਨਰੰਜ ਬਾਤ।","roman":"Anjhanjh gaat | anranj baat |","meaning_en":"Your body is free of entanglement; Your word is free of passion;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਰੰਜ ਬਾਤ: read as 'whose word is without anger / passion'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਟੁਟ ਭੰਡਾਰ। ਅਨਠਟ ਅਪਾਰ। ੯। ੧੬੯।","roman":"Antut bhandaar | anthat apaar | 9 | 169 |","meaning_en":"Your store never runs out; You are unshakeable and boundless.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਠਟ: read as 'not set up (by anyone)' or 'unshakeable'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,170],"number_text":"੧੦। ੧੭੦।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਆਡੀਠ ਧਰਮ। ਅਤਿ ਢੀਠ ਕਰਮ।","roman":"Aadeeth dharam | ati dheeth karam |","meaning_en":"Your dharma is unseen; Your deeds are most resolute.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਤਿ ਢੀਠ ਕਰਮ: of firm (unwavering) deeds."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਬ੍ਰਣ ਅਨੰਤ। ਦਾਤਾ ਮਹੰਤ। ੧੦। ੧੭੦।","roman":"Anbran anant | daataa mahant | 10 | 170 |","meaning_en":"Without wound, infinite, the great Giver.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਨਬ੍ਰਣ: without wound (ਬ੍ਰਣ); also read 'without colour (ਬਰਨ)'."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਹਰਿ ਬੋਲ ਮਨਾ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਹਰਿ ਬੋਲ ਮਨਾ ਛੰਦ। ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","roman":"Hari bol manaa chhand | tvaprasaadi","meaning_en":"Har Bol Mana metre. By Your grace.","page":95,"invocation":"ਤ੍ਵਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ","meaning_status":"draft","note":"The metre's name means 'O mind, utter Hari'."},{"type":"verse","number":[1,171],"number_text":"੧। ੧੭੧।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰੁਣਾਲਯ ਹੈਂ। ਅਰਿ ਘਾਲਯ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Karunaalay hain | ari ghaalay hain |","meaning_en":"You are the home of compassion; You are the destroyer of enemies;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਖਲ ਖੰਡਨ ਹੈਂ। ਮਹਿ ਮੰਡਨ ਹੈਂ। ੧। ੧੭੧।","roman":"Khal khandan hain | mahi mandan hain | 1 | 171 |","meaning_en":"You destroy the wicked; You adorn the earth.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,172],"number_text":"੨। ੧੭੨।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਜਗਤੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ। ਪਰਮੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Jagtesvar hain | parmesvar hain |","meaning_en":"You are the Lord of the world; You are the supreme Lord;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਲਿ ਕਾਰਣ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬ ਉਬਾਰਣ ਹੈਂ। ੨। ੧੭੨।","roman":"Kali kaaran hain | sarab ubaaran hain | 2 | 172 |","meaning_en":"You are the cause of strife; You are the saviour of all.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਲਿ ਕਾਰਣ: read as 'cause of strife (ਕਲਿ)' or 'the cause in the Kali age'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,173],"number_text":"੩। ੧੭੩।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਧ੍ਰਿਤ ਕੇ ਧਰਣ ਹੈਂ। ਜਗ ਕੇ ਕਰਣ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Dhrit ke dharan hain | jag ke karan hain |","meaning_en":"You are the support of the earth; You are the maker of the world;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਧ੍ਰਿਤ ਕੇ ਧਰਣ: read as 'upholder of the earth' or 'upholder of patience (dharma)'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਮਨ ਮਾਨਿਯ ਹੈਂ। ਜਗ ਜਾਨਿਯ ਹੈਂ। ੩। ੧੭੩।","roman":"Man maaniy hain | jag jaaniy hain | 3 | 173 |","meaning_en":"You are honoured in the mind; You are known throughout the world.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,174],"number_text":"੪। ੧੭੪।","page":95,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੰ ਭਰ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬੰ ਕਰ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Sarban bhar hain | sarban kar hain |","meaning_en":"You sustain all; You make all;","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬ ਪਾਸਿਯ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬ ਨਾਸਿਯ ਹੈਂ। ੪। ੧੭੪।","roman":"Sarab paasiy hain | sarab naasiy hain | 4 | 174 |","meaning_en":"You are near all; You destroy all.","page":95,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬ ਪਾਸਿਯ: read as 'near all' or 'who holds the noose over all'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,175],"number_text":"੫। ੧੭੫।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰੁਣਾਕਰ ਹੈਂ। ਬਿਸ੍ਵੰਭਰ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Karunaakar hain | bisvanbhar hain |","meaning_en":"You are the mine of compassion; You sustain the universe;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਰਬੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ। ਜਗਤੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ। ੫। ੧੭੫।","roman":"Sarbesvar hain | jagtesvar hain | 5 | 175 |","meaning_en":"You are the Lord of all; You are the Lord of the world.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,176],"number_text":"੬। ੧੭੬।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮੰਡਸ ਹੈਂ। ਖਲ ਖੰਡਸ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Brahmandas hain | khal khandas hain |","meaning_en":"You are the life of the universe; You destroy the wicked;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮੰਡਸ: read as 'lord / life of the universe'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰ ਤੇ ਪਰ ਹੈਂ। ਕਰੁਣਾਕਰ ਹੈਂ। ੬। ੧੭੬।","roman":"Par te par hain | karunaakar hain | 6 | 176 |","meaning_en":"You are beyond the beyond; You are the mine of compassion.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,177],"number_text":"੭। ੧੭੭।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜਪਾ ਜਪ ਹੈਂ। ਅਥਪਾ ਥਪ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ajpaa jap hain | athpaa thap hain |","meaning_en":"You are the unspoken prayer; You are established yet never installed;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਜਪਾ ਜਪ: the recitation that goes on without being spoken. ਅਥਪਾ ਥਪ: read as 'established without being installed'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕ੍ਰਿਤਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਮ੍ਰਿਤਾਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ੭। ੧੭੭।","roman":"Akritaakrit hain | amritaamrit hain | 7 | 177 |","meaning_en":"You are the uncreated creation; You are the nectar of nectar.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਕ੍ਰਿਤਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ: read as 'uncreated, yet the creator of form'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,178],"number_text":"੮। ੧੭੮।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮ੍ਰਿਤਾਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਕਰੁਣਾ ਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Amritaamrit hain | karunaa krit hain |","meaning_en":"You are the nectar of nectar; You are compassion in action;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕ੍ਰਿਤਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਧਰਣੀ ਧ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ੮। ੧੭੮।","roman":"Akritaakrit hain | dharnee dhrit hain | 8 | 178 |","meaning_en":"You are the uncreated creation; You uphold the earth.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[9,179],"number_text":"੯। ੧੭੯।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਮਿਤੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ। ਪਰਮੇਸ੍ਵਰ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Amitesvar hain | parmesvar hain |","meaning_en":"You are the boundless Lord; You are the supreme Lord;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕ੍ਰਿਤਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਮ੍ਰਿਤਾਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ੯। ੧੭੯।","roman":"Akritaakrit hain | amritaamrit hain | 9 | 179 |","meaning_en":"You are the uncreated creation; You are the nectar of nectar.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[10,180],"number_text":"੧੦। ੧੮੦।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜਬਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਅਮ੍ਰਿਤਾਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Ajbaakrit hain | amritaamrit hain |","meaning_en":"You are of wondrous form; You are the nectar of nectar;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਰ ਨਾਇਕ ਹੈਂ। ਖਲ ਘਾਇਕ ਹੈਂ। ੧੦। ੧੮੦।","roman":"Nar naaik hain | khal ghaaik hain | 10 | 180 |","meaning_en":"You are the leader of humankind; You destroy the wicked.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[11,181],"number_text":"੧੧। ੧੮੧।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਸ੍ਵੰਭਰ ਹੈਂ। ਕਰੁਣਾਲਯ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Bisvanbhar hain | karunaalay hain |","meaning_en":"You sustain the universe; You are the home of compassion;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਨਾਇਕ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬ ਪਾਇਕ ਹੈਂ। ੧੧। ੧੮੧।","roman":"Nrip naaik hain | sarab paaik hain | 11 | 181 |","meaning_en":"You are the leader of kings; You protect all.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਰਬ ਪਾਇਕ: read as 'protector of all' or 'present everywhere'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[12,182],"number_text":"੧੨। ੧੮੨।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਭਵ ਭੰਜਨ ਹੈਂ। ਅਰਿ ਗੰਜਨ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Bhav bhanjan hain | ari ganjan hain |","meaning_en":"You destroy the cycle of birth; You crush enemies;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਭਵ ਭੰਜਨ: destroyer of worldly existence (the cycle of birth and death)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਰਿਪੁ ਤਾਪਨ ਹੈਂ। ਜਪੁ ਜਾਪਨ ਹੈਂ। ੧੨। ੧੮੨।","roman":"Ripu taapan hain | japu jaapan hain | 12 | 182 |","meaning_en":"You torment the foe; You make us repeat Your name.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਜਪੁ ਜਾਪਨ: read as 'who causes the name to be repeated' or 'the One recited in all recitation'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[13,183],"number_text":"੧੩। ੧੮੩।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕਲੰਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬਾਕ੍ਰਿਤ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Aklankrit hain | sarbaakrit hain |","meaning_en":"You are without stain; You are the form of all;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰਤਾ ਕਰ ਹੈਂ। ਹਰਤਾ ਹਰਿ ਹੈਂ। ੧੩। ੧੮੩।","roman":"Kartaa kar hain | hartaa hari hain | 13 | 183 |","meaning_en":"You are the Creator of creators; You are the Destroyer of destroyers.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[14,184],"number_text":"੧੪। ੧੮੪।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਪਰਮਾਤਮ ਹੈਂ। ਸਰਬਾਤਮ ਹੈਂ।","roman":"Parmaatam hain | sarbaatam hain |","meaning_en":"You are the supreme Soul; You are the soul of all;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਆਤਮ ਬਸ ਹੈਂ। ਜਸ ਕੇ ਜਸ ਹੈਂ। ੧੪। ੧੮੪।","roman":"Aatam bas hain | jas ke jas hain | 14 | 184 |","meaning_en":"You are under Your own control; You are the glory of glory.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,185],"number_text":"੧। ੧੮੫।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਸੂਰਜ ਸੂਰਜੇ ਨਮੋ ਚੰਦ੍ਰ ਚੰਦ੍ਰੇ।","roman":"Namo sooraj soorje namo chandr chandre |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Sun of suns, salutation to the Moon of moons;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇ ਨਮੋ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਇੰਦ੍ਰੇ।","roman":"Namo raaj raaje namo indr indre |","meaning_en":"salutation to the King of kings, salutation to the Indra of Indras;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਅੰਧਕਾਰੇ ਨਮੋ ਤੇਜ ਤੇਜੇ।","roman":"Namo andhkaare namo tej teje |","meaning_en":"salutation to the One who is darkness, salutation to the Light of lights;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਬ੍ਰਿੰਦ ਬ੍ਰਿੰਦੇ ਨਮੋ ਬੀਜ ਬੀਜੇ। ੧। ੧੮੫।","roman":"Namo brind brinde namo beej beeje | 1 | 185 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Multitude of multitudes, salutation to the Seed of seeds.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬ੍ਰਿੰਦ ਬ੍ਰਿੰਦੇ: the greatest of all hosts / present in every multitude."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,186],"number_text":"੨।੧੮੬।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜਸੰ ਤਾਮਸੰ ਸਾਂਤਿ ਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Namo raajsan taamsan saanti roope |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One who is passion (rajas), darkness (tamas) and of the form of peace (sattva);","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਰਾਜਸ, ਤਾਮਸ, ਸਾਂਤਿ: the three qualities (gunas): activity, inertia and calm."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਪਰਮ ਤਤੰ ਅਤਤੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Namo param tatan attan saroope |","meaning_en":"salutation to the supreme essence, whose form is beyond the elements;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਪਰਮ ਤਤੰ ਅਤਤੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ: the supreme essence, and the form beyond all elements."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇ ਨਮੋ ਗਿਆਨ ਗਿਆਨੇ।","roman":"Namo jog joge namo giaan giaane |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Yoga of yogas, salutation to the Knowledge of knowledge;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੇ ਨਮੋ ਧਿਆਨ ਧਿਆਨੇ।੨।੧੮੬।","roman":"Namo mantr mantre namo dhiaan dhiaane | 2 | 186 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Mantra of mantras, salutation to the Meditation of meditations.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,187],"number_text":"੩। ੧੮੭।","page":96,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਜੁਧ ਜੁਧੇ ਨਮੋ ਗਿਆਨੇ ਗਿਆਨੇ।","roman":"Namo judh judhe namo giaane giaane |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the Battle of battles, salutation to the Knowledge of knowledge;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਭੋਜ ਭੋਜੇ ਨਮੋ ਪਾਨ ਪਾਨੇ।","roman":"Namo bhoj bhoje namo paan paane |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Food of foods, salutation to the Drink of drinks;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਕਲਹ ਕਰਤਾ ਨਮੋ ਸਾਂਤਿ ਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Namo kalah kartaa namo saanti roope |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Maker of strife, salutation to the One of the form of peace;","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਇੰਦ੍ਰੇ ਅਨਾਦੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੩। ੧੮੭।","roman":"Namo indr indre anaadan bibhoote | 3 | 187 |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Indra of Indras, whose glory has no beginning.","page":96,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,188],"number_text":"੪। ੧੮੮।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਕਲੰਕਾਰ ਰੂਪੇ ਅਲੰਕਾਰ ਅਲੰਕੇ।","roman":"Kalankaar roope alankaar alanke |","meaning_en":"Of the form that ends strife (Kalki), the Ornament of ornaments;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਲੰਕਾਰ ਰੂਪੇ is read in several ways: 'of the form of Kalki', 'destroyer of the stained (wicked)', or 'beyond stain'. Uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮੋ ਆਸ ਆਸੇ ਨਮੋ ਬਾਕ ਬੰਕੇ।","roman":"Namo aas aase namo baak banke |","meaning_en":"salutation to the Hope of hopes, salutation to the One of graceful speech;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਬਾਕ ਬੰਕੇ: read as 'of beautiful / elegant speech'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੰਗੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਨਾਮੇ।","roman":"Abhangee saroope anangee anaame |","meaning_en":"of indestructible form, bodiless and nameless;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਭੰਗੀ ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਲੇ ਅਨੰਗੀ ਅਕਾਮੇ। ੪। ੧੮੮।","roman":"Tribhangee trikaale anangee akaame | 4 | 188 |","meaning_en":"Destroyer of the three worlds, in all three times, bodiless and desireless.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਤ੍ਰਿਕਾਲੇ: present in past, present and future; also read 'destroyer in the three times'."}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਏਕ ਅਛਰੀ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਏਕ ਅਛਰੀ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Ek achhree chhand","meaning_en":"Ek Achhari metre (verses of single-word phrases).","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,189],"number_text":"੧। ੧੮੯।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜੈ। ਅਲੈ। ਅਭੈ। ਅਬੈ। ੧। ੧੮੯।","roman":"Ajai | alai | abhai | abai | 1 | 189 |","meaning_en":"Unconquerable. Indestructible. Fearless. Imperishable.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਲੈ: without dissolution (ਲੈ). ਅਬੈ: without decay."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,190],"number_text":"੨। ੧੯੦।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਭੂ। ਅਜੂ। ਅਨਾਸ। ਅਕਾਸ। ੨। ੧੯੦।","roman":"Abhoo | ajoo | anaas | akaas | 2 | 190 |","meaning_en":"Not of the elements. Unborn. Imperishable. All-pervading like the sky.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਕਾਸ: read as 'like the sky (all-pervading)' or 'everywhere'."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,191],"number_text":"੩। ੧੯੧।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਜ। ਅਭੰਜ। ਅਲਖ। ਅਭਖ। ੩। ੧੯੧।","roman":"Aganj | abhanj | alakh | abhakh | 3 | 191 |","meaning_en":"Indestructible. Unbreakable. Unseen. Who needs no food.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਭਖ: who does not eat (needs no sustenance)."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[4,192],"number_text":"੪। ੧੯੨।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕਾਲ। ਦਿਆਲ। ਅਲੇਖ। ਅਭੇਖ। ੪। ੧੯੨।","roman":"Akaal | diaal | alekh | abhekh | 4 | 192 |","meaning_en":"Timeless. Merciful. Beyond account. Without garb.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[5,193],"number_text":"੫। ੧੯੩।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਾਮ। ਅਕਾਮ। ਅਗਾਹ। ਅਢਾਹ। ੫। ੧੯੩।","roman":"Anaam | akaam | agaah | adhaah | 5 | 193 |","meaning_en":"Nameless. Desireless. Unfathomable. Who cannot be toppled.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[6,194],"number_text":"੬। ੧੯੪।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਨਾਥੇ। ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ। ਅਜੋਨੀ। ਅਮੋਨੀ। ੬। ੧੯੪।","roman":"Anaathe | pramaathe | ajonee | amonee | 6 | 194 |","meaning_en":"Without a master. The Destroyer. Not born from a womb. Not silent.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਅਮੋਨੀ: read as 'not observing a vow of silence' or 'beyond silence'; uncertain."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[7,195],"number_text":"੭। ੧੯੫।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨ ਰਾਗੇ। ਨ ਰੰਗੇ। ਨ ਰੂਪੇ। ਨ ਰੇਖੇ। ੭। ੧੯੫।","roman":"Na raage | na range | na roope | na rekhe | 7 | 195 |","meaning_en":"Without attachment. Without colour. Without form. Without outline.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[8,196],"number_text":"੮। ੧੯੬।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਅਕਰਮੰ। ਅਭਰਮੰ। ਅਗੰਜੇ। ਅਲੇਖੇ। ੮। ੧੯੬।","roman":"Akarman | abharman | aganje | alekhe | 8 | 196 |","meaning_en":"Beyond deeds. Free of illusion. Indestructible. Beyond account.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"heading","kind":"chhand","name":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","gurmukhi":"ਭੁਜੰਗ ਪ੍ਰਯਾਤ ਛੰਦ","roman":"Bhujang prayaat chhand","meaning_en":"Bhujang Prayat metre.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"type":"verse","number":[1,197],"number_text":"੧। ੧੯੭।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਨਮਸਤੁਲ ਪ੍ਰਨਾਮੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੇ।","roman":"Namastul pranaame samastul pranaase |","meaning_en":"Salutation to the One worthy of every salutation, the Destroyer of all;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਗੰਜੁਲ ਅਨਾਮੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੇ।","roman":"Aganjul anaame samastul nivaase |","meaning_en":"indestructible and nameless, dwelling in everything;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਨਿਰਕਾਮੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Nirkaaman bibhoote samastul saroope |","meaning_en":"desireless in His glory, of the form of everything;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕੁਕਰਮੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ਸੁਧਰਮੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੧। ੧੯੭।","roman":"Kukarman pranaasee sudharman bibhoote | 1 | 197 |","meaning_en":"Destroyer of evil deeds, glorious in true dharma.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"}]},{"type":"verse","number":[2,198],"number_text":"੨। ੧੯੮।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਸਚਿਦਾਨੰਦ ਸਤ੍ਰੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ।","roman":"Sadaa sachidaanand satran pranaasee |","meaning_en":"Ever Truth, Consciousness and Bliss, the Destroyer of enemies;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਕਰੀਮੁਲ ਕੁਨਿੰਦਾ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੀ।","roman":"Kareemul kunindaa samastul nivaasee |","meaning_en":"the gracious Creator, dwelling in everything;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਕਰੀਮੁਲ ਕੁਨਿੰਦਾ: the gracious doer (Persian)."},{"gurmukhi":"ਅਜਾਇਬ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ਗਜਾਇਬ ਗਨੀਮੇ।","roman":"Ajaaib bibhoote gajaaib ganeeme |","meaning_en":"of wondrous glory, wrathful towards the enemy;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਗਜਾਇਬ ਗਨੀਮੇ: read as 'wrath upon the foe' (Arabic ghazab, wrath); uncertain."},{"gurmukhi":"ਹਰੀਅੰ ਕਰੀਅੰ ਕਰੀਮਲੁ ਰਹੀਮੇ। ੨। ੧੯੮।","roman":"Hareean kareean kareemlu raheeme | 2 | 198 |","meaning_en":"Destroyer and Creator, gracious and merciful.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"This edition prints ਕਰੀਮਲੁ (kept as printed) for ਕਰੀਮੁਲ."}]},{"type":"verse","number":[3,199],"number_text":"੩ । ੧੯੯।","page":97,"lines":[{"gurmukhi":"ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਵਰਤੀ ਚਤ੍ਰ ਚਕ੍ਰ ਭੁਗਤੇ।","roman":"Chatr chakr vartee chatr chakr bhugte |","meaning_en":"Ruler of the four directions, enjoyer of the four directions;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਸੁਯੰਭਵ ਸੁਭੰ ਸਰਬਦਾ ਸਰਬ ਜੁਗਤੇ।","roman":"Suyanbhav subhan sarabdaa sarab jugte |","meaning_en":"self-existent, auspicious, always united with all;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft"},{"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਕਾਲੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ਦਿਆਲੰ ਸਰੂਪੇ।","roman":"Dukaalan pranaasee diaalan saroope |","meaning_en":"Destroyer of evil times, of merciful form;","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਦੁਕਾਲੰ: bad times (famine / hardship); also read 'the two kinds of death'."},{"gurmukhi":"ਸਦਾ ਅੰਗ ਸੰਗੇ ਅਭੰਗੰ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ। ੩ । ੧੯੯।","roman":"Sadaa ang sange abhangan bibhoote | 3 | 199 |","meaning_en":"ever with us, of indestructible glory.","page":97,"meaning_status":"draft","note":"ਸਦਾ ਅੰਗ ਸੰਗੇ: ever at our side (with our very limbs)."}]}],"ending":null});
